msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083176"
msgid "Although I'd also like to know how things are looking outside,\nI should start with the inside of the school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083296"
msgid "Let's stop by the #C000246204Infirmary#CDEF before we go back to the Labyrinth.\nLike #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF were saying,\nit would be nice to cheer up #C236196003Sakura#CDEF if I can…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083504"
msgid "I place my hand on the Infirmary door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083544"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF should be resting in here, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083600"
msgid "Hm―checking up on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?\nI would like to say that I'll accompany you,\nbut okay. I'll wait here this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083724"
msgid "That girl seems to be hoarding a myriad of\nthings. Though I, too, fancy introverted girls,\nI'm not the best at listening to troubles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083860"
msgid "You're certainly competent at that. But you\ntwo are only companions, got it? You have a\ntime limit of three minutes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083980"
msgid "She's got things troubling her. I really do\nwant to lend her my ear, but as you can see,\nI look a bit intimidating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1084096"
msgid "I would plan to just listen, but it could become\nan interrogation. So on that, you're suited for\nthis. Help her out, #[as a friend][as a fellow woman]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1084252"
msgid "Hmm… something's bugging me about this\nInfirmary. Maybe it's similar to the\ninner sanctum I used to live in, long ago?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1084372"
msgid "Eh? Why? #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's a big pain to me, in a lot of\nways. Also, I'm not inclined to be nice to\nanyone other than my Darling, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1084520"
msgid "She may be an AI, but #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is a human-type.\nIf I go in, our mutual understanding will turn\nsour, so please handle this alone, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1084676"
msgid "You're mainly just checking on the doctor here,\nyes? In my opinion, she's not worth my time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1084772"
msgid "Those the world has abandoned can have\ntheir spirited, complaint-riddled chat.\nI'll go talk with the clerk of that store."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1084896"
msgid "It looks like #C236196003#SVT#CDEF is going to wait in the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1084964"
msgid "It's true there won't be any danger in the Infirmary,\nand even if anything does happen,\nI feel reassured that they'll be keeping watch outside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085108"
msgid "We arrive in front of the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085148"
msgid "…what's with me?\nThe thought of entering is making me\nnervous for some reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085228"
msgid "This was just a plain old room back in the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, but now it has importance to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085336"
msgid "The word \"infirmary\" may have some special meaning,\nbut not because this is the old school…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085432"
msgid "Master, I'll stick around out here.\nGo do what you need to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085496"
msgid "Servants are forbidden here…\nWhatever, I totally don't mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085560"
msgid "Darling, go ahead by yourself.\nI'll wait here in the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085624"
msgid "…hmph. How impudent of her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085656"
msgid "Mongrel. I shall wait here.\nFinish your business quickly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085716"
msgid "Ah, the Infirmary. I understand.\nYou must want to check up on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nThe girl's worked to the bone, tend to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085848"
msgid "You came to the Infirmary to see how\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is holding up, right? I'll wait here.\nChat with her as for long as you need to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085988"
msgid "Infirmary x #C236196003Sakura#CDEF x Visit.\nI understand, of course.\nI'm a reasonable x capable woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086092"
msgid "I shall wait in the hallway, so please hurry\nand get on with the counseling and whatnot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086184"
msgid "Here for the routine visit? Your chances of\nsurvival are directly linked to how her\nperformance maintains. Better treat her well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086316"
msgid "This is as far as I go, right? \"To those who\nmeddle in a person's romance.\" …no, an AI's\nromance――I forgot the rest. Just let loose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086452"
msgid "Etiquette says boys are to be excluded from\ngirls' talk. There's probably enough time for\na cup of tea. Let loose and enjoy yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086588"
msgid "Okaaay, I'll wait heeerree.\nPlease, pay me no mind. Hee hee.\nAs your REAL wife, I have nothing to fear!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086692"
msgid "Pay no heed to me. Do as you please.\nI'll #RUBS   at the Commissary#RUBEbe over there#REND talking to that gloomy man.\nHe carries some rather fine booze."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086848"
msgid "I place my hand on the Infirmary door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086888"
msgid "As usual, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF told me #SVT[she][he][she][he]# \nwould wait for me in the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086988"
msgid "This time I'm not checking up on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to see\nif she's feeling alright,\nso it's not necessary to standby in the hallway…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1087128"
msgid "It's likely the same case for other Servants.\nIf the Student Council Room is a neutral zone,\nthen the Infirmary is all #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's domain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1087280"
msgid "…so you haven't realized it.\nLooks like I should mention that us Servants\ncan't enter the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1087384"
msgid "The Infirmary must be a domain that\npurely belongs to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. You can only enter\nbecause #C236196003Sakura#CDEF invited you in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1087528"
msgid "…I would very much like to go inside.\nBut the truth is, that Infirmary is an absolute\nsafe zone that only #C236196003Sakura#CDEF can withdraw to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1087676"
msgid "Servants, enemies, and I think even #C236196003BB#CDEF\ncan't enter. It looks like you're the\nonly exception, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1087796"
msgid "…you haven't realized yet, you lout?\nBeyond this point, only you and that AI can\nenter. Mighty protections are in place here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1087924"
msgid "It's probable that even #C236196003BB#CDEF can't enter.\nWithin the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, that room is\na literal sanctuary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1088064"
msgid "I-I had no idea…\nSo only #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and I can enter the Infirmary―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1088152"
msgid "…I recall what happened during the preliminaries.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF said she \"knew nothing\" about those days."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1088268"
msgid "Initially, I also thought my memories were\njust jumbled up, but after they returned to me,\nI realized that they were real."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1088392"
msgid "I definitely spent time with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF in this Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1088464"
msgid "Many, many days.\nAs if weary of my fate to disappear the next day,\nI spent many days here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1088556"
msgid "If so―――\nThere's only one other person those\nmemories could've been taken from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1088640"
msgid "I have #C236196003#SVT#CDEF wait for me in the hallway,\nthen I enter the room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1088720"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF must be prohibiting access in and out\nof here because she's busy self-restoring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1088824"
msgid "Peeking into the Infirmary,\nI see that the curtains separating the beds are shut.\nMaybe someone is in there, sleeping?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1088944"
msgid "…there's no need to bother them.\nFor now, let's go consult the Student Council\nabout this written invitation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1089056"
msgid "I don't like the idea of calling #C236196003Sakura#CDEF while she's resting.\nI'll visit the Infirmary some other time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1089176"
msgid "Oh?\nThis doesn't look like a classroom,\nbut it seems accessible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1089244"
msgid "Since it's not locked, I'll go in since\nI'm already looking around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1089312"
msgid "It looks like there's no point insisting.\nI'll quit trying to convince her\nand just go search for other Masters…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1089428"
msgid "The door to the Janitor's Closet is shut tight……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1089480"
msgid "It's locked.\nShe truly has no intention of leaving.\nWhat should we do, Praetor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1089560"
msgid "There are several layers of locks.\nThe sun'll set before we can get these off.\n……well, it's always sunset here, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1089684"
msgid "She really doesn't wanna leave.\nAccording to my 2nd e-mail friend Osakabehime,\nthe shut-in life's sweet as honey―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1089800"
msgid "――――and that as long as she has her online\nfriends and offerings of pizza, she'd love to\nshut herself in for hundreds of years……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1089936"
msgid "Oho. Though plain, it's quite a sturdy lock.\nTo avoid people by gathering a thousand\npadlocks…… it's a plebeian's materialism."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1090068"
msgid "So, what now? Will you find keys for\neach and every one of these trifling locks\nand carefully open them one-by-one?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1090184"
msgid "Naturally, there's only one thing I can do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1090228"
msgid "I put my hand on the door and start shouting\nwhile trying to force it open."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1090304"
msgid "I mean, leaving here would be stupid.\nGoing back to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF means killing\neach other, y'know? Why would I want that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1090448"
msgid "Not to mention, this place is the best.\nI dunno who's paying the electric bill here,\nbut the network here is lightning fast,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1090576"
msgid "and this hard drive isn't in terabytes, it's\nUNLIMITED! I can enjoy all of Earth's amusements\nand I don't even need my protein shakes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1090712"
msgid "To want to leave this paradise,\nthat means YOU'RE the weirdos. Occultish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1090788"
msgid "I'm gonna chill, being the winner over here.\nYou can have your, uh, Sakura Hedgemaze?\nGo have fun killing yourselves out there!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1090916"
msgid "……I'm not getting through to her.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF has no intention of listening to us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091012"
msgid "Since she was eavesdropping on our conversation\nin the Student Council Room,\nshe should already know what's going on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091132"
msgid "And since she declared \"I want nothing to do with this,\"\na half-hearted attempt at convincing her\nwon't get me into that room―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091264"
msgid "Aggh! Your hesitation annoys me!\nMy Praetor has been so cordial, yet you\nlack the courtesy to even show yourself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091380"
msgid "#RUBSPublic Employment Services!#RUBEHELLO, WOOOOORK!#REND"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091440"
msgid "Uggh, enough! I feel super resentful now!\nThis no-good woman! She's so similar to my\npast self that I can't help the flashbacks!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091572"
msgid "……it broke.\nNo, #SVT[she][he][she][he]# broke it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091624"
msgid "The enraged #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's strike destroys the multi-layered lock."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091700"
msgid "It begins!\nLet us trample them, Praetor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091744"
msgid "Search and seizure!\nWe're coming in, #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091816"
msgid "ALRIGHT, OPEN UP LOSER!!!\nWe're takin' that delivery-for-life lump\nof yours and draggin' you under the sun!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1091924"
msgid "Talking fat is the height of absurdities.\nWhy not show us that unseemly flesh of yours?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092012"
msgid "I hear people talking inside…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092044"
msgid "Look, honestly, it's getting stuffy in here.\nI'm telling you to pack your bags and get, man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092140"
msgid "I'd love nothing more than to get out of this\ncramped room ASAP myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092212"
msgid "But no other classroom has the memory this place\nand the Student Council Room has. Once this\nheavy job finishes, I'll leave. Deal with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092352"
msgid "It's not like I'm asking you to help me with\nthis modding."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092412"
msgid "Okay, okay. Unduuuurstood.\nI can't help even if you asked me to anyway.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is jussstt gonnnaa watch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092536"
msgid "Although for some reason,\nI don't feel like I'm getting the nuance right…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092612"
msgid "I'll just be getting in the way,\nso let's leave quietly…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092672"
msgid "…I'm curious about this room,\nbut it might be a good idea to worry about it later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092756"
msgid "I'm a watcher, 'kay?\nI'll reject your invites until my last breath!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092824"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF should be watching what's going on\nin the Student Council Room as well.\nThat's fine for now, so I'll go to the\nStudent Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1092980"
msgid "This is the library.\nIf I find anything I want to investigate,\nit would be a good idea to come here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093084"
msgid "I take a close look at the posters on the bulletin board."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093144"
msgid "I don't see any particularly useful information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093196"
msgid "There are quite a few papers posted on this bulletin board,\nbut the text is so corrupted that it's unreadable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093308"
msgid "Written here is a list of the goods at the Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093364"
msgid "[Apologies, Sold Out Of:  Mega Hot Mapo Tofu]"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093412"
msgid "…this is a very \"unique\" Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093452"
msgid "This seems to be a storage room.\nThere's a mess of old tools piled up inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093532"
msgid "…I don't see anything useful.\nAlso, there's no need to go in and get myself covered in dust."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093628"
msgid "This is the faculty room, but the locked door\nwon't budge at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093696"
msgid "I'll give up on trying to get in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093732"
msgid "I try lifting up the fire extinguisher."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093772"
msgid "…well, whatever.\nI wasn't planning on using it anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093828"
msgid "Mixed in with stuff like notebooks and pens are\nan arrangement of several kinds of souvenirs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093924"
msgid "The entrepreneurial spirit here is palpable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1093972"
msgid "On the entrance here is written, \"Restroom.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094020"
msgid "No need to go in right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094048"
msgid "It's a decorative plant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094076"
msgid "Why the long face?\nNew troubles, again? Or…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094124"
msgid "As if lured in by those words,\nmy lips start to move on their own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094192"
msgid "Wow. You met someone like that? Now I see why\nyou look so down: you've come to know who\nyour true enemy is, finally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094312"
msgid "That girl dragged the management NPCs from the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF to here and overwrote my #RUBS role#RUBEduty#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094444"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF also levied all the earnings from this\nCommissary. Good heavens.\nWhat a pain in the neck."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094556"
msgid "So, my desire to do business has tanked. After\nnegotiating, we settled on having her take\n5% of my net profits as a \"protection fee.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094692"
msgid "…I'm surprised how petty they are.\nBoth #C236196003BB#CDEF and this priest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094772"
msgid "But by the sound of it, this priest loathes #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nIf so, maybe he can go a little easy on his prices…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1094892"
msgid "Those are two different things. I offer proper\ngoods for proper prices. That's what they call\n\"a clerk's pride.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095008"
msgid "I may have fallen from being supervisor of the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF to a hired shop manager―but\nI'm still the same person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095144"
msgid "From this moment still, as a cold clerk,\nI'll watch over the agonies that befall you all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095236"
msgid "You're looking very tired. Looks like your\nsearch of the Labyrinth is quite demanding.\nHow about it? Want one?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095348"
msgid "…I'm happy for the sympathy, but I know that\ndrink is going to cost me, won't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095432"
msgid "Is that so? Alright, then it's business as\nusual. Consult with your wallet, and please\nwindow shop to your heart's content."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095556"
msgid "After all, you're the only one who really uses\nthe Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095620"
msgid "Then, you must have a lot of time on your hands…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095672"
msgid "Of course, a lot of time.\nBut in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, my role was\nnever an active one to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095788"
msgid "Now I am here whenever a purchase must be made,\nand can't be ignored whether you like it or not.\nThe splendid life of a Commissary keeper."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095928"
msgid "…now that I think about it, he's right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1095972"
msgid "#C236196003Kotomine#CDEF seems pretty ecstatic,\ndespite being a clerk who just stands around…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1096068"
msgid "Hello there, customer.\nI have news of new goods that have arrived."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1096136"
msgid "New goods have arrived…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1096164"
msgid "Today we received an outfit for a Servant.\n…heh. Little trinkets just aren't\nworth my time, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1096268"
msgid "I got it by having #C236196003Sakura#CDEF obtain it in spite of\nstrict security. You didn't get a scene for it,\nbut it played out like an action movie."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1096420"
msgid "Included in the price is the cost of my labor\nand my medical fees.\nFine items require necessary expense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1096528"
msgid "Okay. I'll transfer purchased clothes to the\ncloset in your My Room.\nUse it whenever you please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1096628"
msgid "His services are on point―they scratch those\nitches I can't reach myself.\nThis priest, no, this clerk is nothing to scoff at!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1096756"
msgid "Sometimes what I ship out gets delayed, but if\nthat happens, just bear with it, tears rolling\ndown your face. Haha, how terrible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1096888"
msgid "…I have a few gripes about that service\nbut don't have the luxury to complain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1096968"
msgid "Great sacrifices are always made behind the\nscenes to support convenience.\nEven this priest must be hustling\nin other endeavors."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1097100"
msgid "Well, I only work within the rules, but are you\ntrying to imply something? This store has a\nno-complaint policy on deliveries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1097228"
msgid "Well, now. Seems you made it out safe and sound,\ntoo. It's that stupendous luck of yours…\nNo, maybe I should say \"devil's luck\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1097360"
msgid "Seeing him standing exactly where he always does,\nhere in the Commissary, makes me feel a little relieved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1097468"
msgid "…I wonder, how did #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF managed to escape #C236196003Julius#CDEF' raid?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1097564"
msgid "I never told you about this, but I dabble in\nBājíquán as a hobby.\nThough, I'm just a novice imitating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1097668"
msgid "No, we didn't fight. Perhaps he knew of my\nskills, or perhaps he had no reason\nto confront me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1097764"
msgid "In any case, he didn't make any moves on me.\n…it's a little disappointing. Sometimes I\nwant to try Zhen Jiao'ing someone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1097888"
msgid "For that one moment, #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF,\nwith his faint smile, looked like a hellish fiend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1097988"
msgid "A cold sweat runs down my back.\nMaybe it was wise for #C236196003Julius#CDEF to have not attacked him…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1098092"
msgid "I regret to tell you that I'm not conducting\nany business right now, despite being open.\nI have no goods to sell, you see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1098216"
msgid "Now this is unexpected, considering hardly\nanyone drops by the Commissary.\nMaybe a shipment of goods got delayed?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1098332"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF came by a moment ago. He bought\nout the Commissary's entire stock of items.\nSomething about \"cooking lots of stuff.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1098480"
msgid "I'm pretty sure stuff like stationery was\nsold in this store, as well. If he bought\neverything up, then that means――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1098600"
msgid "Not hard to guess, it seems. What in the world\nis he trying to cook up? Who does he plan to\nfeed it to? I'm on the edge of my seat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1098732"
msgid "All I'm getting are REALLY bad feelings about this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1098784"
msgid "In any case, it appears that you won't get the\nchance to buy any items for a while.\nUse what you have wisely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1098896"
msgid "I have nothing to sell at the moment. I'm open,\nbut can't do any business. Please bear with\nme for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099012"
msgid "Rejoice, young #[man][lady]#.\nA new, special good has arrived."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099076"
msgid "…now this is a rare sight.\nI get the sense that #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF is in a good mood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099172"
msgid "What new good could have done this to this priest?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099224"
msgid "I believe it will meet your expectations.\nHave a look for yourself.\nAfter, amazement will hit you like lightning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099340"
msgid "Wait, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI have something I must ask you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099404"
msgid "What's the big deal all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099444"
msgid "It looks like #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is trying to come off as composed,\nbut his expression is kind of grave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099556"
msgid "――――I see. Very well, then.\n…very, VERY well, actually.\nI sense something sinister in that stuff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099660"
msgid "Don't eat too much of it. Adjust to the\nflavor, make it a staple meal if need be. I'll\nbe the one severing our contract, otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099792"
msgid "So, it's the final battle at last.\nAre you ready?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099844"
msgid "I answer #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF with a small nod.\nI made it this far, no reason to quit now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099940"
msgid "Very good.\nAnd that's precisely why I run my business."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1099996"
msgid "Up 'til now I've sent off countless Masters,\nbut the experience of seeing you off\nas a clerk――as an ally, wasn't bad at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1100124"
msgid "I'll probably forget this ever happened once\nyou've won and the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF returns to normal―\nFor now, I'll indulge in this little miracle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1100280"
msgid "Oh nameless Master. The survival of the Moon\nand the future of humanity has now\nbeen left in your humble little hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1100400"
msgid "You fight for what you want―live for what\nyou wish―and would destroy this\ndream of paradise so you can finally wake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1100520"
msgid "On behalf of all the NPCs trapped here in the\nFar Side, we thank you for your valiant efforts,\nand we support you in this final battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1100656"
msgid "――Now, I bid you go forth.\nFrom this corner of an old, forgotten school\nbuilding, I'll be praying for your victory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1100776"
msgid "…I take a small bow\nand turn my back to the Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1100836"
msgid "I hesitated to thank the supervisor, #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF,\nwhen he thanked me, but I at least wanted to express\nmy gratitude through that small gesture."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1100996"
msgid "By the way, do you have enough items prepared?\nMy business is open―with critical acclaim―\nuntil this world's last second of existence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1101136"
msgid "If you have funds to spare,\nthen please buy as much as you need,\nmy valued customer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1101224"
msgid "#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF palmed it off onto me.\nApparently, it takes effect if you're in a pinch\nwhile getting it on with a kind-hearted woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1101372"
msgid "My gut says it would look great on you.\nI'll offer it to you for a special price."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1101456"
msgid "This looks like the Commissary.\nA selection of goods are on display."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1101528"
msgid "I was considering buying something,\nbut the clerk is nowhere to be found."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1101604"
msgid "You look like someone with troubles.\nCare to talk about them with a supervisor turned\nclerk like me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1101708"
msgid "Good timing.\nI'll try asking him for some advice about money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1101772"
msgid "Unfortunately, this is one thing I can't help\nwith. Since ancient times, money has flowed from\ncustomer to shop―not the other way around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1101912"
msgid "Just as the flow of time is eternal,\nso too is the flow of money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1101980"
msgid "Money is something the customer gives to me.\nThis is the universe's Providence.\nI shall engage in absurdity for no man…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1102104"
msgid "Despite all that, basically, does he just really\nnot want to admit he doesn't have any money…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1102200"
msgid "Not at all. Like they say, \"Money doesn't\ngrow on trees.\"\nWell? You going to buy something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1102292"
msgid "I'm pretty sure this woman is… oh, yeah.\n#C236196003Taiga#CDEF… #C236196003Fujimura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1102384"
msgid "This was the \"previous school building's\" new teacher.\nSince she was a teacher, I figured she was\npart of management―――an NPC prepared by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nbut she may be a Master too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1102588"
msgid "? #C236196003Taiga Fujimura#CDEF, you say?\nHow peculiar… I don't remember ever calling\nmyself by such a charming name…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1102712"
msgid "The nun casts her eyes down, looking troubled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1102760"
msgid "This lady… #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, smiles gracefully.\nHer gaze is warm, as if she's grateful from\nthe bottom of her heart to meet me again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1102900"
msgid "Despite the entire situation we're in,\nher gaze makes me unconsciously blush."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1102980"
msgid "Yes. Consumed along with the school in the\npreliminaries. Luckily, I'm fine as you\ncan see. I'm still in one piece."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1103096"
msgid "If you doubt whether this is dream or\nreality, then would you like to touch me and\nfind out? Go on, no need to hesitate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1103220"
msgid "…no, I need to calm down.\nThis isn't the time for this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1103280"
msgid "What's important is that we both went\nthrough the same ordeal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1103344"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF was also in that school building\nand was swallowed by the Black Noise?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1103440"
msgid "From the first floor hall, I called out to you\nas you went towards the stairs.\nDo you remember that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1103544"
msgid "…I see. In that moment, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF was also asking for help.\nThe reality is that she was left in that building,\nand ultimately no one came to rescue her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1103712"
msgid "No, it's alright. Please don't blame yourself\ntoo harshly. That was your best option\nat the time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1103812"
msgid "Besides…\nYour regret more than makes up for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1103864"
msgid "You cared enough to feel regret over my loss,\nsomeone you only ever spoke to once before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1103956"
msgid "With a \"thank you,\" #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF expresses heartfelt\nappreciation towards #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\nwho had abandoned her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1104104"
msgid "…a warmth rises in my chest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1104136"
msgid "Even if her words were just concern over my sense of guilt,\nher wholehearted \"gratitude\" was genuine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1104240"
msgid "She gently smiles as if embracing the\nbehavior and personality of another person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1104324"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF's modest conduct is seldom seen in everyday life.\nSomeone like this will definitely join the Student Council.\nBelieving that, I explain about #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1104536"
msgid "…the Student Council, you say?\nCertainly, if leaving is the goal, the best\nthing would be for everyone to work together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1104660"
msgid "No way!\nThe other Masters are one thing,\nbut for her to refuse joining is…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1104740"
msgid "I don't want to soil your determination with\nsuch a trivial thing, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI'm very sorry, but please leave me be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1104872"
msgid "I understand how much she's concerned for me.\nSo much that it hurts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1104944"
msgid "But… she doesn't want to leave?\nWhat could that be all about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1105008"
msgid "Perhaps I could say… that in accepting that\nwhich is impossible, my heart has been broken."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1105100"
msgid "Though I say that, I have tried escaping\nin my own way. However with my power, all I\ncan do is open a rift to the outside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1105224"
msgid "The moment I step outside, my power will not\npreserve my form, and I will likely\nbe deleted. The same for my Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1105344"
msgid "When that happens… when you escape,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, will you abandon me\nhere without a second thought?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1105460"
msgid "I'm sure you'll hesitate, due to being\nunable to abandon those who are powerless.\n…that would be a twofold tragedy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1105580"
msgid "…don't look so sad.\nThere's no need to worry. After all, this school\nbuilding isn't such a bad place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1105684"
msgid "This means they have a generous heart,\ndoes it not? The same happened in the\nother school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1105784"
msgid "However, no one can say for sure how\nlong that \"someone's\" generous heart will last."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1105872"
msgid "That is quite so.\nThus, I won't reject everyone of the Student\nCouncil. I think I will support you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1105972"
msgid "…I have no choice but to back off if she says that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1106028"
msgid "No one understands a Master and Servant's\nability better than the Master themself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1106112"
msgid "It would be irresponsible for me, a stranger,\nto interject if #C236196003Kiara#CDEF herself says she's not strong enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1106236"
msgid "Hee hee.\nYou really are a troublesome one.\nPlease don't make that face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1106308"
msgid "I, #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF, am still so depraved that\nI prioritize only my own life, but I shall\nsupport you covertly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1106436"
msgid "That's the one thing which must be\nconcealed throughout the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF above all else:\na Servant's #C000246204True Name#CDEF. And she spoke it with no issue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1106616"
msgid "She's truly given up on going back alive.\nShe's showing her hand to me,\nsomeone who would've eventually become her enemy,\nbecause she doesn't want to return to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1106812"
msgid "Famous for \"The Little Mermaid\" and \"The Little Match Girl\";\none of the world's three greatest fairy tale writers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1106928"
msgid "Were the fairy tales I heard at bedtime\nso many times really written by this young boy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1107016"
msgid "No need to bother mentioning my class.\nSince, befitting this awful Master,\nI'm a vulgar Heroic Spirit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1107120"
msgid "But what a shockingly ordinary face you have.\nNo anguish, no sorrow; just someone cast out of\nthis world, playing the victim."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1107248"
msgid "Very nice, not bad at all.\nExactly how a clown SHOULD look."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1107308"
msgid "They say idiocy is a sin, but a toss out\nof society is fortuitous for the mediocre.\nNow you can enjoy good and evil!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1107428"
msgid "Don't trust others.\nDon't trust women.\nAvoid THIS woman especially, at least."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1107508"
msgid "Flesh; words; thoughts; outcomes. These\nare all poison to the ordinary person.\nCuriosity killed the cat, as they say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1107628"
msgid "The sermons of the holy are unbearable to\nthe masses. If they come out of this woman,\nthey're even harder to bear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1107744"
msgid "…enough. Once your mouth opens, it's all\nhorrible things. All I did was confess to my\nlack of will and ability to resolve all this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1107880"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF.\nPerhaps the inside of a box DOES suit you\nbetter than being outside?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1107976"
msgid "Hmph. All I did was speak when you told\nme to speak. And once I take off,\nmy scribble-scrabbles don't stop, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108108"
msgid "You're the one who ordered me to guide\nthese commoners. I don't mince words.\nBeating around the bush doesn't help anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108232"
msgid "I will disparage that person's worth\nas best I can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108284"
msgid "…*sigh*. Again with that talk. We've been\ntogether for a while now. Haven't I been\ntelling you not to attribute worth to people?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108416"
msgid "―――The same applies to you, young Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108464"
msgid "He looks at me with a discerning gaze, as if appraising me.\nHe doesn't look like a young boy―he has a mature presence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108584"
msgid "You intend on being the lead in your\nown story, right?\nYes, that's the truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108664"
msgid "But that stage will one day appear,\nand your story will end as unbearable trash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108748"
msgid "Everyone is a lead actor, but only a few\nwinners can pull off a great performance and\nbring the curtain down on a masterpiece."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108876"
msgid "Therefore, do not stop.\nDo not squander.\nDo not waste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108932"
msgid "If you want to realize your dreams, don't\nsit here listening to a critic's voice. Get out\nthere and work like a mule, you third-rate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1109068"
msgid "Hee hee. You see what kind of Servant he is,\nbut please be nice to him. Deep down,\nhe's an honest and good person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1109184"
msgid "I-is that so.\nIf #C236196003Kiara#CDEF hadn't smoothed things out,\nright about now #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gilgamesh]##CDEF would've probably jumped\nout and start hurling insults―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1109384"
msgid "Anyway, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF turned down joining the Student Council,\nbut will cooperate as much as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1109496"
msgid "I apologize, but I cannot join the\nStudent Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1109548"
msgid "However, if there is anything else I can do,\nthen I'll support you as much as I can,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1109660"
msgid "Hmph. You look like quite the sucker,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF. She's a hypocrite\nand uses that to butter people up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1109784"
msgid "…and with that, I'm sure I've been all\naround the school building.\nI'll stop by the Student Council Room and report to #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1109928"
msgid "Oh my. What a grave expression you have.\nI heard that you forayed into that strange\narena. Did something happen in there?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110052"
msgid "I tell #C236196003Kiara#CDEF about what occurred in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110144"
msgid "About how, with the backup of the Student Council,\nwe forayed into that unknown arena."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110232"
msgid "Wow… oh my goodness. All that happened while\nI was here timidly counting stains on the\nwall due to my lack of power…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110352"
msgid "Yet, I'm so relieved. Hmhm. The #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF, you say? You look so well-behaved,\nbut you're #[still a boy, after all.][quite lustful, aren't you?]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110520"
msgid "I mean, for so many people to be\nforcibly entering #C236196003Sakura#CDEF…\nI wonder if it was her first time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110632"
msgid "To be told of such a raw scene so upfrontly…\nI'm a woman, so, you know…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110708"
msgid "…I'm changing my opinion of her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110744"
msgid "Huh? That's not what you're talking about?\nThe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the name of the Arena?\nOh my. My my my."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110868"
msgid "I'm sorry. You had to listen to one of my\nselfish delusions. Of course. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF\nwould never do such a thing. Hohohoho."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111004"
msgid "…I wonder if #C236196003Kiara#CDEF has any in-depth knowledge of sex at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111084"
msgid "I explain the situation to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and ask for her advice.\nAny little detail she might think of will help."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111208"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF stares straight at me and\nrebukes me for trying to destroy the Shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111312"
msgid "…however, this isn't the time to be\nsaying such things, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111376"
msgid "Something like: \"I won't forgive you if you\ntouch that door\"―\"treat female enemies with\ndelicacy\"―\"I hate to say it, but I feel it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111512"
msgid "…I recall my conversation with #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nNow that I think about it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111596"
msgid "\"Don't look into someone's heart.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111632"
msgid "A mental wall, materialized from human emotion…\nfrom the \"true character and qualities\none cannot show to anyone.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111748"
msgid "In short, it's how the mind guards its secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111796"
msgid "There's a practice in psychotherapy of\n#ROFS0004#RUBS  diving#RUBEsneaking#REND into a patient's psyche to rid them\nof the source of their anguish…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111948"
msgid "In those cases, walls are very likely to appear.\nUltra-hazardous barriers which repel,\nor obliterate, pseudo-Spiritronized #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112120"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is likely unfamiliar with medicine…\nwith clinical psychology.\nNaturally, he wouldn't understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112240"
msgid "Admittedly, this is also the first time I've\nseen something of such size and strength.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF is vehemently rejecting us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112376"
msgid "A mental wall… That's what that Shield really is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112428"
msgid "Which means that wall is #C236196003Rin#CDEF's self-defensive mind.\nBeyond it lies #C236196003Rin#CDEF's secrets―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112548"
msgid "Hey, what are you so excited about? Your heart\nis beating faster. Well, that said,\nI'm getting all giddy as well!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112664"
msgid "Not wanting to reveal yourself―wanting to see\nwhat's hidden―are parts of human psychology,\nbut you have to mind your manners first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112800"
msgid "Oh boy… By that logic, then that wall is\ncertainly going to be a sturdy one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112880"
msgid "Or rather, normal logic won't do zilch. A\nmaiden's mind is hardy when keeping secrets,\nlike a millennium Yakushima Cedar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1113004"
msgid "A wall that keeps secrets, now?\nIf no lock exists, then I can't even demonstrate\nthe power of my Key of the King's Law."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1113124"
msgid "If so, then I think drastic measures are\nneeded. I'll help you, with my limited ability."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1113216"
msgid "Please go on ahead to the Student Council\nRoom. If I suffice, I can teach the\nbasics… of unraveling a person's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1113336"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF, who had no intention to before,\nnow tells me that she'll help us deal with the Shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1113448"
msgid "I can this say this went better than expected.\n#C000246204I'll go report to Leo in the Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1113564"
msgid "A mental wall in the Labyrinth appears,\nthen one of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's offshoots took form―――\nI had a feeling it would come to this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1113704"
msgid "So #C236196003Rin#CDEF's true self is in there after all…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1113764"
msgid "Even #C236196003Sakura#CDEF says she can't make a gate.\nLike with the #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF, we may need a special skill\nthat's different from what #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF usually use―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1113988"
msgid "…indeed.\nHowever, this is a closely guarded ritual that\nI cannot instruct you on so readily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114084"
msgid "Therefore―――\nI shall assist you in entering the Wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114144"
msgid "You have obtained many of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's secrets,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. With three, I believe you can\n#ROFS-007#RUBSinfiltrate her mind#RUBEPsycho Dive#REND even further."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114328"
msgid "I must warn you, though. A person's heart\nunconditionally refuses visitors.\nIf you go, confrontation will be unavoidable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114452"
msgid "With this many fragments of her mind,\nI can send you into the depths of her\nconsciousness right away, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114580"
msgid "However, you should head to #C236196003Leo#CDEF first.\nWe won't be late even if you proceed to battle\nafter developing a strategy with everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114728"
msgid "There's a sort of lack of time here.\nIf you rest for a moment, no, a mere day, or a\nweek, it won't change a thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114844"
msgid "What's most important is that you're okay.\nI heard a summary of what happened\nfrom #C236196003President Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114960"
msgid "Did you hear this? All the people captured\nin the Torture Chamber had their consciousnesses\nreleased from the Net Ocean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115084"
msgid "Certainly, we may still be sailing in the dark,\nbut people were saved by your actions.\nI graciously thank you on their behalf."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115212"
msgid "Being thanked by her like this makes me feel\nproud about triumphing over #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115312"
msgid "The extension of the Labyrinth.\nThe appearance of the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115396"
msgid "This bombardment of bad things kept me\nin low spirits, but on the other hand,\nit sounds like I was able to be of help to someone―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115532"
msgid "Although, we don't have the time to chat idly,\nright? I definitely saw the footage of the\n#C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115652"
msgid "I thought she would be some sort of demon, but\nno, she's an adorable girl. Sweet #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF…\nHmhm. She's a nice girl, isn't she?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1115800"
msgid "I think she's a nice girl."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1115828"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115848"
msgid "That's wonderful. In my opinion,\nshe must wish to know you better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115916"
msgid "To know others is to hurt others.\nThe pain of knowing and being known is grievous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116000"
msgid "Oh dear. You don't think so?\nPersonally, I enjoy the awkwardness\nof such people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116084"
msgid "The reticent, awkward, cowardly, inarticulate―\nThey tend to be misunderstood, but they\nhave compassionate minds too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116204"
msgid "Skill in communication isn't the only thing\nthat determines whether a person is worthy\nof love, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116308"
msgid "Please look after what's inside that girl.\nSurely a childish, charming face of a young\ngirl is hidden within."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116420"
msgid "That may be because she only glanced over the footage.\n#C236196003Kiara#CDEF doesn't seem to be afraid of #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116556"
msgid "Still… No matter how charming she appears,\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF has fiendish claws on both hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116664"
msgid "Servants can take it, but for a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND,\njust touching them would mean instant death.\nI believe being cautious is human instinct, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116848"
msgid "Praetor, you're agonizing over the wrong thing.\nPut your opinions of that #C000246204Ego#CDEF aside.\nAsk about the #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116984"
msgid "#C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF. I won't have you misleading my\npure Master. #[He's][She's]# a novice who has\nplenty of troubles as it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117116"
msgid "No, we've had enough with that Oppai Monster's\nstrength as a heroine. We'd like to ask\nwhether or not her #C000246204SGs#CDEF could be extracted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117264"
msgid "Woman. I have no interest in your preaching.\nThis one shall gauge that #C000246204Ego#CDEF girl.\nWhat we need to know is about #C000246204SGs#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117412"
msgid "#C236196003Lip#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF? In that case, nothing changes.\nActually, I think it may be easier to extract\nthan with #C236196003Rin#CDEF and such."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117572"
msgid "Though an offshoot of #C236196003BB#CDEF, she does have a heart.\nNo, perhaps I should say that it's because\nshe's #C236196003BB#CDEF's offshoot that she has a heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117740"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF split her functions into #C000246204Egos#CDEF.\nAfter that, she composited many Servants\nwith them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117860"
msgid "As a result, the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are independent――\nThey are separate from #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nand gained hearts that weren't born from AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118012"
msgid "But, it's ironic. They were only just born, so\nthey don't know how to conceal their minds. They\nhaven't developed along with their secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118152"
msgid "Thus, you should be able to extract the gaps,\nthe weaknesses of her mind by merely\nconfronting her. But there's one condition―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118280"
msgid "A condition?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118296"
msgid "A condition?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118312"
msgid "A condition-al clause?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118336"
msgid "You were able to discuss things with #C236196003Rin#CDEF and\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, but reaching a mutual understanding with\nthose girls will prove difficult."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118496"
msgid "You'll most likely end up fighting. Prepare as\nif it will always turn into a fight, and please,\ndon't show them any mercy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118620"
msgid "…I see.\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF was the combat proxy for #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118724"
msgid "But it's different for an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\n#C236196003Lip#CDEF herself is a combat machine with the\nabilities of a Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118860"
msgid "I take #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's warning to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118912"
msgid "I'll brace myself then #C000246204head for the Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118976"
msgid "I found #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and #C236196003Andersen#CDEF in the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119052"
msgid "…I recall what #C236196003Rin#CDEF told me about #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's background.\nI was a little hesitant, but I tried asking\nher about whether it was true or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119220"
msgid "\nIf all the adherents connected to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF killed themselves――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119300"
msgid "I don't think that this willowy woman\nwould be in the middle of such a maelstrom of death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119392"
msgid "What I thought or what my goals were\nwas irrelevant to the people. The only thing\nleft in my hands was the outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119508"
msgid "The lives of many people were consumed\nby my own avarice. However――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119580"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF looks puzzled,\nas if miserable from the bottom of her heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119664"
msgid "Her expression makes me think of a\nterrifically beautiful and fleeting heaven lotus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119752"
msgid "They loved me by their own will,\nbecame despaired by their actions, and at the\nend of their love, ended their lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119872"
msgid "There was no bloodlust in them to be found.\nThey simply drowned in me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119944"
msgid "They went insane, as if despairing from that\ntruth, as if craving and lusting insatiably for\nme―― As a result, they ended their lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120084"
msgid "I wanted to save them.\nThey wanted me to save them. In the end,\nthey died, and that's all there is to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120192"
msgid "Saying that, she smiles.\nSorrowfully. With such beauty that any who\nsaw it would be touched."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120288"
msgid "And that's why――I find it difficult to consider her human,\nin terms of her mentality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120376"
msgid "As a religious leader, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF treated many people impartially\nand lavished them with love.\nThat resulted in those adherents becoming swollen with desire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120548"
msgid "\"I beg you, I want you to love only me――\"\n\"More, more; I want endless love from you――\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120640"
msgid "But that wasn't allowed.\nAs a consequence of treating everyone equally,\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF possessed no love towards individuals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120784"
msgid "…and then, their practically immolating desire\nwas how they literally were destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120872"
msgid "Because they went and recognized #C236196003Kiara#CDEF as a saint,\nthey became aware of their essentially\nsalvation-less reality and despaired."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121016"
msgid "They probably could have returned to their lives\nif they distanced themselves from #C236196003Kiara#CDEF,\nbut perhaps because they had known this\nalmost Bodhisattva-love,\nthey couldn't leave the palm of her hand――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121232"
msgid "For now, please don't be concerned with my\naffairs. Please focus on defeating #C236196003BB#CDEF\nand returning to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121384"
msgid "…and after, if a time comes when we face\neach other as Masters in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF――\nTHEN, please charge me with my sin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121528"
msgid "I hope you'll tell me the answer as to\nwhether my Eiten school's doctrines\nwere correct or incorrect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121632"
msgid "Without replying to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's smile,\nI leave her presence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121708"
msgid "This is Heaven's battlefield;\na garden of selfishness where wishes\nare put on the line."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121796"
msgid "I'm certain that #C236196003Kiara#CDEF isn't special.\nHere, everyone fights for themselves――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121892"
msgid "Give it up.\nIt's not something you young ones\ncan sink your teeth into."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121964"
msgid "It's a narcotic that provides the fleeting\npleasure she seeks yet is loathe to mention, as\nmuch as it befits this filthy feline."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1122096"
msgid "\"Pleasure leads to the pearly gates\" is the\nsort of justification typical for this woman to\nuse for her evil deeds. Why do you need it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1122232"
msgid "…it's true that the #RUBS  Ten-thousand Colored Stagnation#RUBE#C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF#REND\nis a dangerous Code Cast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1122372"
msgid "Because networks have become the foundation for human society,\nan ability which can utilize networks to dominate others\nis equivalent to an ability that dominates the world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1122548"
msgid "But right now we have to depend on it, even if it's taboo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1122608"
msgid "The Student Council Room has been hacked by #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1122680"
msgid "and the #RUBS  Ten-thousand Colored Stagnation#RUBE#C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF#REND is necessary to save #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nI explain all this to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1122868"
msgid "…………now this is precarious. I fully\nunderstand what you're saying, but…\n…I really do have a problematic nature…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1122988"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF looks downwards, uneasy.\n…she's probably right to feel reluctant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123088"
msgid "And the reason is because I'm not only inquiring about\nthe existence of a Code Cast considered to be the greatest\noffense in cyber history―I'm also asking to borrow it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123260"
msgid "…get in return?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123280"
msgid "Did she say she won't get anything in return?\nWell, she IS lending me something that belongs to her.\nOf course she should get something in return.\n…I didn't expect her to bring up something like that though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123492"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF has always exercised foresight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123556"
msgid "She's resolute, possesses an enlightenment\nnormal people like me won't reach,\nand is beyond good and evil―――\nEven she's thinking in this way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123704"
msgid "I never expected her to do something as materialistic as,\nlike, refuse because she won't get anything in return―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123824"
msgid "There's nothing off here. Simply put, this vile\nwoman would, for the sake of her own ego, save\nor even kill hundreds of millions of people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123964"
msgid "But if someone won't satisfy HER pleasure,\nshe won't lift a single finger."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124040"
msgid "She'll welcome you with open arms if YOU\njump into her bed, but she would hate to\nget up, even to peel an apple!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124156"
msgid "*sigh*… Mister #C236196003Andersen#CDEF. All the ladies will\nend up disliking you if you keep speaking\nyour mind so freely, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124292"
msgid "Ha! As if I would ever date a woman who hates\nme for speaking my mind! Who in the hell would\nenjoy my vitriol, anyway?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124412"
msgid "Hee hee, indeed.\nOnly someone like you can see my\ntrue intentions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124480"
msgid "Who would've thought that famous fairy tale\nwriter was like this? Fate truly is ironic.\n…now then. #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124608"
msgid "I know. \"Give these young ones something\nto give me,\" right?\n…really now. How filthy can you get?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124708"
msgid "Young #[man][lady]#. Sorry, but this is an order from my\nMaster. We shall take our leave off to #C000246204somewhere\nin the Labyrinth#CDEF. If you want this, come."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124872"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF pulls out a massive book,\nand after muttering something,\nthe two of them vanish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124980"
msgid "They didn't just… run away, did they!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1125020"
msgid "They did―― and they made a grand escape,\nat that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1125072"
msgid "Damn. He mentioned the Labyrinth, no?\nBest place to hide away is the #C000246204deepest area#CDEF…\nLet's go after them, Praetor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1125204"
msgid "…and here we go.\nAlthough I didn't expect this to be easy,\nnow it's turned into a headache."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1125300"
msgid "Let's head to the Labyrinth. They're probably\nin the #C000246204current deepest floor#CDEF. \nWe'll just have to settle this there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1125432"
msgid "Huh? His Master is the one you don't get?\nHmm. Personally, I don't care much about her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1125520"
msgid "How do I put it? He's got that instigating,\n\"I'll be the one that takes you down\"\nsort of thing going on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1125628"
msgid "…well, whatever. Let's go search the\nLabyrinth, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND. They've got to be in\nthe #C000246204lowest area#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1125764"
msgid "Was that a Noble Phantasm? I suppose this means\nthat lowly fairy tale author's specialty is\nin disappearing and rearing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1125888"
msgid "Anyway, pursuing them is the only option. They\nmust be in the #C000246204deepest part of the navigable\nLabyrinth#CDEF now. Then, we just take by force."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126040"
msgid "Oh dear. It appears that something is troubling\nyou. What happened?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126108"
msgid "However, I'm afraid to say I cannot help you.\nI am one who is disconnected from the secular\nworld. I carry no money on my person…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126240"
msgid "#C000246204Please wait in the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nI'll also be there soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126324"
msgid "…how very regrettable. A human heart has\nbecome a Labyrinth wall… it will only get hurt\nthat way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126424"
msgid "Though it may certainly be a sturdy bulwark, I\nam reluctant to approve of it, for the heart\nmust be handled much more carefully."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126556"
msgid "However, people have many secrets.\nIt is likely that one will not suffice.\nPlease be prepared for more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126660"
msgid "Hidden within the depths of a stout woman's\nheart, an innocent desire inexpressible to\nothers… Putting it to words may excite me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126792"
msgid "Hehe. Though it may be immodest,\nI'm kind of looking forward to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126860"
msgid "Know that, for a Master of my ability, I had\nno choice but to do that in order to survive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126952"
msgid "I won't make any excuse, but know that I\nlament my own weakness too…\nPlease just understand that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127052"
msgid "Ha! Stupid woman, it serves you right!\nThis is because you contracted a third-rate\nServant like me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127152"
msgid "If you do that, then I can finally get some\nsatisfaction over being pushed around by a\ncow like you every day!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127264"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nJust when did I ever force you to do cruel,\nbackbreaking labor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127356"
msgid "If that's what you desire, then I wouldn't mind\nusing the power of my #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF to toss\nyou into the Labyrinth right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127500"
msgid "I went too far with my impoliteness. So lay off.\nReally, don't do it. I hate manual labor\nmore than anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127612"
msgid "I get it. I made a mistake in calling you a cow.\nThat metaphor was too straightforward! I\nshould've said something like \"Melons' Pass\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127748"
msgid "E-excuse me.\nI bought some Ohagi cakes at the Commissary\non a whim…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127820"
msgid "Um. It's indecent for a woman like me to be\nthankful for sweets, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127904"
msgid "That's why… I hid myself alone somewhere and\nate them… but I ended up being seen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127988"
msgid "I really can't be doing bad things… I can't\nbelieve I let #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF see such an\nembarrassing side of me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128112"
msgid "This is a lonely place, isn't it?\nSure, there are people to talk to,\nbut they're mostly just NPCs…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128212"
msgid "In this #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF, there's no distinction between\nhumans and AI, but…\nRaw desires run thin here… *sigh*."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128336"
msgid "The sensation of being nude is truly one of\na kind. I would love to have a long talk\nwith #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128448"
msgid "A Habit of Exposure and worshipping nature are\ntwo different things. You mean to say being nude\nequals being wild? How uncivilized, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128604"
msgid "I heard that a new Sentinel appeared.\nI wonder what kind of being #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are?\nI'm curious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128716"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF have minds like humans, but what\nbecomes a Core is not an achromatic mind, but\na mind which was discolored to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128868"
msgid "These girls have been unbalanced from\nthe very start. Please don't forget that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128952"
msgid "\"#C000246204Masochistic Constitution#CDEF\" you say… Hmhm.\nSuch a constitution may be a burden to her,\nbut to some, it's irresistible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129088"
msgid "Indeed.\nPriests are good at attaining spiritual\ninsight from hurting themselves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129172"
msgid "Isn't that right, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?\nYou've got PROFOUND insight into THAT, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129256"
msgid "Yes, well, you could say that I too have\nsomething of a #RUBS      family view#RUBEpersonal#REND opinion on pain――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129376"
msgid "W-wait, no!\nWhat are you making me say, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nI know nothing of this. No comment!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129480"
msgid "The skills I trained for back on Earth\nweren't learned in vain, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129552"
msgid "I feel like I've been beaten to the punch…\nI secretly had my eyes on you, but… huh?\nThat's not it? It's part of your strategy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129684"
msgid "Ah… no, I shouldn't be glad about this.\nIt's a strategy for capturing an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\nIt's going to be dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129816"
msgid "Please be careful.\nI'm praying that you'll return safely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129876"
msgid "In a sense, between all of them, she may become\nthe most troublesome opponent yet.\nPlease stay focused."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129980"
msgid "…occasionally,\nI think it's necessary to make a level-headed\ndecision. Please keep a stout heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130080"
msgid "All humans tell lies.\nOne could say it's like an\narmor that protects one's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130164"
msgid "SHE'S pure? Hmph, how stupid. She's not pure.\nShe just knows nothing about the world. Just a\n#RUBS      newb #RUBEsulky child#REND without enough experience points."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130332"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mental wall is surely\na formidable one, but her Servant is\nthe one who piques my interest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130448"
msgid "The Heroic Spirit, #C236196003Karna#CDEF―――\nI've heard that his strength rivals that\nof the great hero of Indian myth, #C236196003Arjuna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130596"
msgid "In the Near Side's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, I say he's\nof the highest tier, without a doubt. Please be\nsure to gather plenty of experience, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130752"
msgid "Thanks to my pact with #C236196003BB#CDEF, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF and I\nmade it out without being attacked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130864"
msgid "Have you met with the others?\nIt seems everyone is doing alright."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130932"
msgid "Hm? You want to know why I stand in this corner?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130984"
msgid "Well, there's no particular reason,\nbut being in the corner is less stressful\nthan being in the center, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131100"
msgid "She's just staying all the way back, so the\nhealthy boys and girls don't notice her. Even\nTHIS woman knows about right place and time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131236"
msgid "Unleashing the people's desires… Perhaps #C236196003BB#CDEF's\nobjective is her duty as a health management AI\ntaken to the extreme."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131372"
msgid "However, it only applies to their minds.\nHuman happiness lies in the union of\nmind AND body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131468"
msgid "Her ideals are too underdeveloped. I'm no match\nfor her, but you're capable of putting her\nwicked intentions down, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131608"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, why is it that you wish\nto see the depths of the Labyrinth so badly?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131704"
msgid "…sorry, that was a foolish question.\nPlease forget what I just said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131776"
msgid "You're gathering information…? What an\nincorrigible loafer you are. I don't mind. As\nlong as it's about those around me, I'll help."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131912"
msgid "My Master, as you can see, is a self-indulgent\nand fickle woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131980"
msgid "You demand me to cooperate with you all, on\nwhatever game it is that you're playing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132068"
msgid "You think I'm some sort of lending library that\ncan't get by? Very genial of you! But this is\nalso a business; readers don't get to choose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132208"
msgid "Let's write about Servants this time.\nSo. What should I talk about?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1132276"
msgid "I think we've talked for long enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132316"
msgid "Ahh. The dragon girl that #C236196003BB#CDEF hired.\nUgly woman. Her appearance is a given,\nbut even her disposition is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132436"
msgid "Her upbringing is ugly. Her ideologies are ugly.\nHer idiosyncrasies are ugly. Her sensitivity is\nugly. She blinds me with her ugliness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132572"
msgid "At a glance she looks proud, but the truth is\nthat no one looks at her. Her pride doesn't come\nfrom anything anyone ever gave her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132704"
msgid "She's an absolute laughingstock! That woman\ntreats humans like pigs. Which means, she's\nproud about fighting none other than pigs!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132836"
msgid "She's the personification of one ruled by\nself-love, but hey, what is love in the first\nplace? Something one steals? Or gives?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132964"
msgid "A woman who can't even realize their own essence\nis a most uncontrollable monster. That\nwoman seems to be proud of her beauty, but―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133100"
msgid "Hah. Even if you dress up the outside of a\nbag of shit, the rotten smell within probably\nwon't change much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133208"
msgid "Though, it IS in a woman's nature to cling to\nbeauty. You should be careful.\nAn ugliness like hers is contagious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133324"
msgid "Sooner or later, you'll have to speak similar\nvitriol to those girls you're acquainted with,\ntoo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133424"
msgid "…this is a good chance to have him tell\nme about #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133504"
msgid "Just who is that arrogant Servant?\nHow should I go about keeping him in check?\nPlease, I want to know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133608"
msgid "Your Servant, you say? Let's see.\nBring them out. I'll appraise every nook and\ncranny of theirs, down to their asshole."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133728"
msgid "…Praetor, I have a headache. Certainly,\nmy limbs are peerless works of art comparable to\n#RUBS         nectar  #RUBEfruits of the gods#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133872"
msgid "\"I want to see-I want to see at any cost…!\"\nTo desire such from me must be natural.\nIt's how I feel all the time, too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133992"
msgid "How-ever! I already serve as a knight for my\nMaster, and am one maiden who embraces #[his][her]# love.\nMy apologies, but I can't reciprocate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1134136"
msgid "Relieve your lust some place else. And anyway,\nisn't making nude figures the work of sculptors?\nAre you possibly a sex-fiend, scum?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1134268"
msgid "Don't make light of me. I'm a virgin. I have no\ninterest in your toddler figure. I'm only\nlooking at your character and personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1134404"
msgid "I…! H-hmhmhm.\nPraetor, this discussion ends here. There's\nnothing you need to hear from this man!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1134504"
msgid "In the first place, you're the one I most…\n…didn't want to know about me. Though, I see.\nCertainly, I understand your apprehension."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1134640"
msgid "Supplementing your lost memory with information\nisn't a bad move to make. I'll give you special\npermission. But―forget about this man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1134776"
msgid "Low-life. I can only see you as an extreme\nmisanthropist. Being cynical of humans is fine,\nbut don't drag my Praetor down a path of evil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1134916"
msgid "You're also mistaken there.\nI don't hate humans at all.\nIt's just that \"women\" make me vomit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135012"
msgid "…however, you're right about one thing.\nYou and I are definitely incompatible. Even if I\ncomment on you, it wouldn't be fair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135140"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. That's who your Servant is.\nMaybe you shouldn't always believe her, but that\nmoron is worth depending on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135272"
msgid "…yeesh. This guy's got a foul mouth. Where did\nyou leave those fairy tales you're so good at\nmaking? You'll disappoint your former readers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135416"
msgid "My style is to keep readers at a distance. I've\ngot no reason to follow their orders. I shun the\nspotlight and am devoted to my own affairs―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135560"
msgid "Isn't that what we call being a \"man\"? It's\nnaught but a self-righteous and unrewarded life.\nI think you and I are one and the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135696"
msgid "It hurts to hear what I can't refute―more than\nit should. I don't deny the self-righteous part,\nbut―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135804"
msgid "I don't have such deep affection that\nI'd resent what doesn't concern me.\nRight, how's this―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135904"
msgid "You don't bear any resentment, right?\nOnly regret. \"If only I had done this;\nI wanted to see this kind of future;"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136020"
msgid "If there's a next time, then for sure I'll――\nI want to save those who wanted to be saved.\" A\ndull force drives you, nameless Heroic Spirit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136164"
msgid "Idiot. A man like you becomes a slave to the\nmasses. You work hard for a hero of justice who\nsays he doesn't need to be just."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136292"
msgid "Now, to answer your question, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nYour Servant is an ally of the weak; the\npersonification of selfless devotion―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136432"
msgid "He fancies having his happiness weighed against\nthe happiness of others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136508"
msgid "Also, apply this type of personality to\nyourself, too. In all that's been happening\nnow, you've been poking your nose in places."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136640"
msgid "Good grief, how unpleasant. Let's say that\nyou're well-matched comrades who resemble one\nanother. You should get back to saving people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136776"
msgid "―――Hehehe. You think you can spew out any\nvitriol by virtue of being a little boy? Okay,\nto the roof―you're flying to the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136916"
msgid "Aren't we both foul-mouthed? And what's with\nthose fox ears, anyway? Talk about being sly.\nYou're the embarrassing one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137036"
msgid "They're NOT sly, they make me charming!\nNot that a child like yourself would\nunderstand, though!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137136"
msgid "I'm a cat ears man, myself. For argument's sake,\nyou can even assume I'm into dog ears. Fox ears\nhave less meaning than a misspelling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137272"
msgid "Crawl back to your fox hole.\nMy pen won't be dripping any ink to write\nabout you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137356"
msgid "Close one… I almost blew up the Sun with my\noverwhelmin' rage… I haven't been this\nhumiliated since that DAMN Abe no Yasuchika!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137488"
msgid "Darling, let's go! Better to be safe than sorry\nwhen dealing with such sour, precocious brats."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137584"
msgid "Hold on, fox ears. My perception of you has\nchanged. Your ears aren't bad. Their ugliness is\nespecially nice. Let me take a closer look."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137724"
msgid "Hey! What are you doing touching them!?\nI-I haven't even gotten my Darling to touch\nthem yet!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137820"
msgid "Well. Hmm. Let's see. I get it now.\n…tsk. They're real."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137880"
msgid "…*sigh*. And here I was hoping this would be\nsome new type of costume play.\nI'm disappointed in you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137984"
msgid "YOUR entire character is a disappointment!\nWhy does it feel like you're only being\nhard on me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138080"
msgid "Old habits die hard, you know.\nEven though I'm fed up with it all, I still\nget a kick out of the fairy-tale-esque."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138196"
msgid "Darling, guide me! This boy is so feeble he'd\nfly away if you blew on him―guide me to\nsend him tumbling away, pl… ease?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138320"
msgid "…oi, you precocious brat.\nWhat's going on under those clothes of yours?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138396"
msgid "What? Interested in my naked body?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138432"
msgid "Ah, yes. I overheard a theory on how pink means\nsomething or another, once. However… you're\nquite sharp sighted, no, sharp eared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138564"
msgid "As you've guessed, my skin can't be shown. It's\nthe curse of the Little Mermaid and Little Match\nGirl. My own stories are eating away at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138708"
msgid "This is damage due to rumors from my readers.\nEvery time I write a book, they just decide that\n[this author must be this kind of person]."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138848"
msgid "My legs are covered in merman scales;\nmy arms are riddled with burn marks;\nmy mind is that of a fiend fond of bad ends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138968"
msgid "Such is the price of fame. Or rather, I've\ncaptured my readers' true nature. I took for\ngranted what these people thought of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139100"
msgid "It's the same for you, fox ears. Right? Although\nyou were adored by humans, even reincarnated by\nthem―in the end, you were seen as a monster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139244"
msgid "In Japanese children's literature, there's a\nstory called \"Gon, the Little Fox.\"\nYou're precisely like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139356"
msgid "After loving and serving humans, all that awaits\nis an incomprehensible death.\nHowever―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139452"
msgid "Serving despite knowing that is precisely why\nthey're moved so. Fox ears. That devotion of\nyours, well, they'll appreciate it someday."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139588"
msgid "―――Hmph.\nIt's none of your concern, and you have the\nwrong impression."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139664"
msgid "…but, I guess bearing my fangs against a child\nwould be immature. I'll forget about sending\nyou tumbling around for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139788"
msgid "That was quick. Fawning over me already?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139832"
msgid "Even if the Sun were to die out,\nI would neeeevvveerr fawn over someone like you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139916"
msgid "This man's mouth never ceases. Your disrespect\ntowards the king warrants a skewering before you\ncan even apologize. However―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140048"
msgid "There's no reason to rise over offenses if\nthey're staked over one's live. Indeed―you've\ngrazed against death, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140172"
msgid "Yes, indeed. Death flags raised with light-speed\nare likewise followed up on with light-speed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140268"
msgid "Let's just say that this was expected of an\naudacious, insistently pacifist and orthodox\nprotagonist. Be as grateful to me as you can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140404"
msgid "Let's just say that this was expected of an\naudacious, insistently pacifist and orthodox\nyoung lady. Be as grateful to me as you can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140540"
msgid "You're kidding me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140560"
msgid "Moron―you're the disrespectful one, mongrel!\nLetting someone else decide a king's worth for\nyou, moreover in my presence? How very dull!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140700"
msgid "If this lowly purveyor of words hadn't presented\nto me his life, I would have decapitated\nyou right here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140808"
msgid "But before, you told be I could \"investigate\nyou however I liked…\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140876"
msgid "Learning history from others and learning\nthrough the opinions of others are\ndifferent things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140972"
msgid "While this man exists as a mass of ego,\nhe will loathe the biased views which drift\nabout the minds of the masses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141088"
msgid "\"If you wish to know me, try achieving so by\nyour own inquiry\"―― This is the aesthetic\nyou're engrossed with, no? #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141236"
msgid "Your talk is dry, but your judge of character is\nsuperb. I likened you to a mad dog athirst for\ndeath, but you're like an intrepid adventurer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141380"
msgid "You stake your life to speak the truth.\nAll of your wild words are staked on your\nvery soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141476"
msgid "To you, the very twisting of words is death of\nthe soul. Compared to that, being killed\nis not a fear worth having. Am I correct?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141608"
msgid "Absolutely correct. That's the reason why I\nwill save myself, #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141704"
msgid "Since you said that you wish to sever my tongue\nfrom me, I'll start speaking about your\nevaluation, without holding back!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141828"
msgid "I'll start at the conclusion: you fail as a\nServant! I wouldn't give you a single,\ndamn point!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141924"
msgid "Now, how are you as a Heroic Spirit?\nYou're a joke in that regard, too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141996"
msgid "In any document you read, #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF was a\nviolent person who tormented his country and his\npeople. \"The people's king\"? Laughable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142144"
msgid "You ruled without governing; a fool who joined\nHeaven and Earth. That's the King of Heroes. You\ncan never call yourself the \"people's king.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142288"
msgid "Your kingship was just mere ruling. You decided\non your own to be the king, but your way is no\ndifferent from a tempest possessing will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142428"
msgid "First, destroy. You can't promise good harvest\nunless it's after that. And yet you mercilessly\nscrape up the riches your subjects create."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142568"
msgid "Greed; cruelty; and vanity.\nCultivate these to their final form, and the\ncombined result is YOU."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142668"
msgid "Y-you can't say all this so close to him…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142712"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF stands imposingly without\nmoving―not even a twitch.\nHe's observing #C236196003Andersen#CDEF's abuses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142844"
msgid "It wouldn't be strange if he started slashing\nat this very moment.\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF looks―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142952"
msgid "Serfs cultivate crops; kings cultivate\ncountries. But you didn't even do that. You only\ndevoted yourself to killing and gloating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143084"
msgid "Your people, subjects, and your legend won't\nfollow after you.\nAll that will be left is [yourself]."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143184"
msgid "This contract must also be nothing more\nthan a game to divert you from your boredom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143272"
msgid "You're the arbiter who indulges in the hearts\nof others without actually understanding them.\nThat's who you REALLY are, #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143420"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF. Don't think for a\nsecond that you'll ever come to comprehend this\nman. Consort with him as a Master―only."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143560"
msgid "Alright―――\nGo ahead and take my life now!\nI finished saying what I wanted to say!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143648"
msgid "Hmph. I have no need for your life. It's not\nworth a single coin. That wasn't even an\nevaluation, anyway. It's a tale you imagined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143780"
msgid "If we call it an embellished topic on the king,\nyou can place it somewhere in the far end of\nyour library."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143888"
msgid "That's good to hear, I didn't really want to die\nh―――Wait. Isn't this an acknowledgement of\nmy evaluation?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144000"
msgid "Then you can pay up! You can't listen for free\nand still consider yourself the famed\ngolden king!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144100"
msgid "It is what it is.\nOffset by your vilification of me, even a famous\nbook comes out to be worth such."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144200"
msgid "If you want payment, then revise the next one,\nmongrel. Though, I doubt a literary master of\nsuch twisted disposition would do so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144332"
msgid "You're asking about me? How extremely pointless.\nAnd, you're very stupid. As you can see, I'm\njust a regular guy, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144460"
msgid "…no, no.\nI asked since you've been a total mystery\nsince I laid eyes on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144540"
msgid "What kind of abilities do you have?\nCan you fight with that height of yours?\nAnd like, why are you in the form of a kid?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144664"
msgid "How would I know? I was already in this form\nwhen I was summoned. Naturally, I have no combat\nabilities. I'm basically useless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144792"
msgid "Even if we assumed that #C236196003Kiara#CDEF was an A-Rank #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND,\nshe probably wouldn't have won anything with this Servant,\nlet alone the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145012"
msgid "Also, it's said that Servants appear in a\nform during their prime, based on their legend\nand anecdotes about them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145128"
msgid "Aren't I following it? For me, I was brimming\nwith the most sensitivity during my days as a\nkid. That's one explanation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145252"
msgid "There is something I remember, now. I looked\nover the materials from my earlier years, but\nthe style was so aimless that I wanted die."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145388"
msgid "Don't worry about me. Even prodigies turn into\nregular people after turning 20. It's like that.\nWhat's even more frightening is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145520"
msgid "Though I find it unthinkable, I can't deny.\nPerhaps that wicked woman summoned me as\nthis age out of her own personal preference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145652"
msgid "Just asking it even makes ME scared to know\nwhat the truth is. Thus, I'm not going to\ntouch on this subject."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145764"
msgid "Oh dear, oh dear.\nI hear a cheerful voice for some reason.\nMay I join in this conversation?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145856"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF lets out a heavy sigh.\nI can sense that he feels more depressed than he should be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145964"
msgid "I'll refrain myself from pursuing this question as well…"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1146024"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF's #C000246204Matrix#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146076"
msgid "So you don't need me for anything? You're truly\na fervent one. Like the youth you are, use your\nown eyes and ears as best you can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146208"
msgid "Care to listen to a disillusioned impression,\ncast hastily with limited information?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146296"
msgid "Although youth is a time where mistakes are\npermissible, the absolute entity who grants\npermission here is that #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146428"
msgid "That woman is a bundle of narcissism. She\nappears concerned about others, but the reality\nis that her true nature isn't concerned."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146560"
msgid "Since true natures can't be seen, her words\ncan't be taken for anything other than for show;\nwords said for their own sake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146684"
msgid "My lord! It makes me shiver how empty they are!\nLike a child who doesn't know how to handle\nfire, warming up too close beside the hearth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146824"
msgid "Even when she starts to char,\nshe can't stop roasting her flesh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146892"
msgid "Now she can't even remember what she intended\nto do for that flesh. That's her, alright.\nThat's the kind of woman she is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147016"
msgid "What is it? Still want to talk? Didn't you\nlisten when I warned you to neither\ndivert from your path nor undermine yourself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147144"
msgid "Fine, I'll obey HER accursed command and\nhave a nice chat with you. Don't worry,\nit'll only cost you three kroner!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147260"
msgid "This time―――\nYeah, I'll write about Masters.\nPick something out of the catalog."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1147344"
msgid "This reader has had enough for the day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147384"
msgid "About you? Is your head on straight?\nYou've got a real pair on you, don't you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147464"
msgid "Actually, that pair you have on your chest is\npretty average. Maybe modest, even.\nA person can't be this destitute, wait…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147588"
msgid "Wonderful, demand is sky high right now!\nDon't let shameless girls with laden bags\ndrive you out―go and thrive in your niche!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147716"
msgid "His grossly obscene meddling went too personal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147764"
msgid "If this was the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, I might've gone\nSword Or Death with this Servant right about\nnow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147880"
msgid "Asking someone ELSE to do your self-analysis for\nyou is beyond stupid; it's wisely brave.\nVery well. I'll have myself a peer into you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148016"
msgid "…that sounds much too inflated for you,\nthough. You're pretty lousy, see? The archetypal\ngeneric-savior template protagonist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148144"
msgid "Loved by readers, loved by the characters in\nthe story, even loved when it all ends.\nIt's boring. Easy acting isn't MY style."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148272"
msgid "There's nothing I can say about you, and you\nhave no more WORTH than that. Don't ask again\nuntil yesterday comes… no, just, never."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148404"
msgid "…*sigh*. Don't you think it's a cruel thing to\ntell someone they're not worth discussing about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148504"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF's sharp tongue brings so much trouble.\nI apologize, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148608"
msgid "Idiot, you've got your facts all wrong. I didn't\nsay that I \"didn't feel like discussing.\" I said\nthat \"there's no substance to discuss.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148748"
msgid "I talk about tales of people who lose things.\nThe circle of paying one's life, trying to break\nsomething down, and that life ending."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148884"
msgid "But, that's all too soon for you.\nI'm just a bitter person, who speaks of tales\nonly about drawing something out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149000"
msgid "Don't get sidetracked by this. Get to unveiling\nthese secrets, come to know yourself, and race\ntowards a future of flitting ups and downs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149140"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF says, indifferently."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149188"
msgid "Maybe I'm imagining it, but that voice sounds a bit like―――\nThe warm wishes of one praying for the safety of the\nyoung who are departing for battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149340"
msgid "Oh dear, how unusual of you.\nOr could it be, you're actually good at heart,\n#C236196003Andersen#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149444"
msgid "I got teary-eyed all of a sudden. Hehe.\nYour big sister here might start feeling\nways she shouldn't about you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149556"
msgid "What older sister, you mass of sin?\nLook in a mirror and get off to your OWN\nslovenly curves, you obscene bitch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149672"
msgid "She's lost sight of many things for the sake\nof one thing, one goal.\nThat's called \"dumb.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149764"
msgid "Her idiocy is what's frightening. Despite all \nshe's lost, there's just one important thing\nshe'll never give up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149880"
msgid "I know I'm throwing a question at your question,\nbut what does someone like YOU think of #C236196003BB#CDEF?\nIs she stupid? A nuisance?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1150016"
msgid "She's stupid."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1150032"
msgid "She's a nuisance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150052"
msgid "Okay, what do you think about her behavior?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1150096"
msgid "…it's cute, I guess?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1150120"
msgid "…it's scary, I guess?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150144"
msgid "Hmph. You really are dumb too.\nYou forgot that we're in #C236196003BB#CDEF's domain.\nGood job splaying all of your thoughts out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150276"
msgid "Don't blame me if she gets back at you later.\nThat woman answers kindness with loathing\nand loathing with kindness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150392"
msgid "Well, no matter. If #C236196003BB#CDEF flurries over hating\nyou, making her forget about us,\nthat would be helpful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150508"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is evil and our mutual enemy.\nSince #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and I have no power to fight,\nwe're merely leeching off of your labors."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150660"
msgid "As payment for our leeching, I'll give you\none piece of advice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150724"
msgid "Don't forget that. There's a reason for\neverything. A #[man][woman]# who only solves problems is\nunfit to be a protagonist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150848"
msgid "So you want to know about this woman.\nShe's exactly how she looks, but which\nanecdote do you want to hear?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150956"
msgid "How she brought salvation to lost, sentient\nbeings of this world? Or how she preyed\non her believers who sought salvation?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151080"
msgid "I'm only telling the truth. #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF:\nthe last guru of the Shingon Tachikawa school\nwho lived long and poorly on Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151224"
msgid "This woman was an aid in saving others\nfrom carnal desires, and thus was also a\ngorgeous harlot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151324"
msgid "After saving many people, she betrayed\nthose she had saved.\nWhat's disgusting is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151412"
msgid "She continued that way of life and kept\noffering help to people with outstretched hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151504"
msgid "There's a limit to how much one should maintain\ntheir interests. This woman's bodhisattva vice\nis essentially just #RUBSNaraka#RUBEHell#REND now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151652"
msgid "…the Shingon Tachikawa school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151684"
msgid "I think I heard that Shingon #ROFS-005#RUBSesotericism#RUBEMikkyo#REND\nwas a sect of Buddhism,\ngenerally considered to be heretical."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151820"
msgid "Supposedly, a man and a woman unify,\nand in their combined union destroy the border of the self,\nuniting with the universe through power drawn from \"the beyond\"…\nIn other words, the fundamental idea behind their technique\nis to achieve enlightenment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152072"
msgid "Incidentally, they worship the deva Dakini.\nThe deva Dakini means the Dainichi Buddha,\nor in other words, Amaterasu."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152192"
msgid "Although, this is all in the context of an earlier age.\nIn the modern day, all magic and secret rituals have ceased."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152312"
msgid "Even Mount Koya, which drove away the\nShingon Tachikawa school to the recesses of history,\nhas opened up Buddhism in a new form."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152444"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF only shared bits and pieces,\nbut it sounds like #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's ideologies\nare based on the Tachikawa school,\nand she saved many people from becoming spiritually lost."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152656"
msgid "There's a reason why a woman like her\njoined the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\nShe must desire the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF in order to―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152804"
msgid "All I can do is satisfy my own desire.\nI want to save people. That shameless desire\nis why I joined this battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152920"
msgid "I'm no different from other Masters.\nAll wishes have equal value. Whether a wish is\ngood or bad isn't something to be compared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153048"
msgid "I, for myself.\nYou, for yourself.\nThat's the right way for a person to be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153124"
msgid "Ha! You've gone to extremes again!\nMaster. Your pleasure doesn't consist\nof only yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153216"
msgid "Your salvation doesn't care about people.\nYou take their selfish desires into yourself.\nTHAT'S what you delight in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153332"
msgid "You prey on others, but when there aren't\nany others around, you're not worth shit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153416"
msgid "…deary me. You really surprised me there,\nMr. Brain Damaged."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153480"
msgid "What unnecessary, useless delusions. I took you\nfor a has-been writer with material inferior to\nthird-rate smut, but you do have insight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153620"
msgid "Parasite―――\nYes. That word and God's real name are\none and the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153692"
msgid "……all of a sudden,\n    for no real reason, a chill ran up my spine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153764"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF catches #C236196003Andersen#CDEF's insults with a tender smile.\nAnd that's because she appeared beautiful beyond compare."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153908"
msgid "While being called ugly, her philosophy\nis to smile \"righteously.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153976"
msgid "…the thought of what sort of a hell one\nmust see, as I feared, to reach that level\nwas enough to send a chill through me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154100"
msgid "Young people these days won't even browse,\nI see. Fine, go watch some video or something.\nDon't mind me, I'll also watch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154224"
msgid "First an #C000246204Ego#CDEF, now some dropout? There's such a\nthing as too much event variety. Just how\nunlucky can you be with your allies?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154368"
msgid "\"Truth is stranger than fiction,\" huh?\nDocumentaries aren't my forte, but if you're the\nsubject, my pen may just start moving a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154504"
msgid "So what are you saying? You want #[him][her]# to suffer\neven more? Go through further misfortune?\nHow can you hope for such things…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154640"
msgid "…ahh, what a hard tale to hear.\nThe more #[he][she]# struggles, the deeper #[he][she]# sinks…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154736"
msgid "The agony of a #[handsome boy][beautiful girl]# engulfed in a \nbottomless swamp is like forbidden nectar――\nI, too, wish to plunge in and be drowned――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154892"
msgid "………sorry about that. The longer humans\nlive in abstinence, the bigger the recoil. How\nthis woman got to this point is a mystery."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155024"
msgid "The best we can do to forget this gaffe is\nto change the subject… So, what will\nbe our topic this time…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155132"
msgid "I know. How about we talk about the women\nyou've faced here?\nWhich silliness would you like to hear about?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1155240"
msgid "That's enough of this silliness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155276"
msgid "Alright… Since you're offering,\nlet's talk about #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155356"
msgid "#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF: a freelance #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND who's\nmade a name for herself throughout Asia."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155500"
msgid "And supposedly, a young hacker who opposes\n#C236196003Leo Bistario Harwey#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155580"
msgid "She's active, and moreover, always sticks to her\nprinciples. Clearly she's a hungry woman,\nbut more of a doe than a leopard, really."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155716"
msgid "Anyone would take her for an independent woman,\nbut it's no more than pretense. She can't\nlive without controlling herself to be so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155852"
msgid "Her brilliance came from hard work. No other\ncreature is as pleasurable to observe as one who\nis brimming with talent and is industrious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155992"
msgid "That only applied to you. Being raised like\na princess and cherished since birth does not\nguarantee having a decent personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156124"
msgid "Besides, #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF may come from a prodigious\nlineage, but she was born merciless. She had\nno living relatives growing up, see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156272"
msgid "That must be the reason why she can't get\nused to being honest about her feelings,\nand why she never shuts up about money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156396"
msgid "It is who she is, but it doesn't show. Although\nhuman nature tends to being a certain way,\nit can't become only one-dimensional."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156528"
msgid "Imagine an hourglass.\nThe sand runs out,\nbut the glass doesn't change shape, does it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156616"
msgid "Human nature is the same way. The opposite\nnature does become empty, but one can't resist\nthat noticable emptiness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156732"
msgid "The result is the forbidden desire to return\nsand to their \"present and opposite character-\nistics.\" In order to balance themselves right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156872"
msgid "#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF follows her own ideals so closely\nthat her weaknesses stand out like a sore thumb."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156984"
msgid "Saying \"I want someone to control me\" is a\ndesire only verbalized by those who know the\ngood and bad about being the one in control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157120"
msgid "One can't be a sadist without being industrious,\nand one can't be a masochist without\nbeing insatiable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157224"
msgid "Which one is the slave, and which one is giving\ntheir service? Questions like these all\ndepend on how you look at it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157344"
msgid "It all depends on how you look at it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157384"
msgid "How you look at what, specifically?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157420"
msgid "At love, I suppose.\nOne could say that the person with the stronger\nlove truly is the one \"in control.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157524"
msgid "Everything leads to this same conclusion.\nThat's why society is a joke! Ultimately,\nit topples over from something like that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157652"
msgid "*sigh*―― This man is truly a thorn in my side.\nBlasting such rude comments out to the world,\nhe's going to drag me down with him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157784"
msgid "Please restrain yourself, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157844"
msgid "Alright… Since you're offering,\nlet's talk about #C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157924"
msgid "#C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF: the final homunculus, left by an\nalchemist said to be hiding out in the\nAtlas Mountains of Egypt even now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158060"
msgid "My first thoughts are, \"new human race.\" In\nWestern Europe, where clones have no rights,\nshe'd probably be treated as an AI with flesh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158196"
msgid "Being weaker than humans, it must be a struggle\nto survive in nature, but this is the electronic\nsea― A world where computing is power."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158336"
msgid "#C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF possesses the same specs as that\nof a supervisory AI created by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158460"
msgid "She's passive, and moreover, believes that ends\njustify means. Clearly she's an aloof woman, but\nmore of an innocent girl than a doll, really."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158604"
msgid "She's a vessel that's still in the process of\nmaturing. She can't tolerate the contradiction\nof logic; that impurity called \"chaos.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158740"
msgid "Looking at when she was tasked in \"guarding the\nLabyrinth,\" I say she was one level better\nat being a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF than #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158908"
msgid "An innocent little girl…\nYou're talking about the girl who\nwanted to manage things?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158996"
msgid "Yeah. Management is an ideal. One can't allow\noneself to divert from that ideal. You could\nsay it's like being meticulous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159120"
msgid "Meticulous… Hmm, well…\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG2#CDEF is a far cry from being meticulous,\nI think…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159236"
msgid "Like I said, underwear and whatnot is\nexcess that she can't allow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159304"
msgid "Try walking around naked after a bath. You'll be\npractically screaming, it's so refreshing. Also,\nI often do it when I get writer's block."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159444"
msgid "Is that so? By the way, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF.\nIs there any work you're\nundertaking at the moment?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159548"
msgid "My current task involves one volume, that's it.\nWhat, is there an additional request? I'm\nover capacity. You want me to suffer MORE?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159684"
msgid "Good to hear. …though, it's a bit dreary not\nhaving requests. How about it, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF? I happen\nto be plotting out an extra-long novel…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159836"
msgid "I would never agree to that. You use up magical\nenergy to go running around, naked. Just what is\nyour Noble Phantasm, streaking?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159968"
msgid "――――――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159984"
msgid "W-what's the matter, everyone?\nYou've suddenly gone silent.\nDid I say something I shouldn't have…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160084"
msgid "No, not at all. So yeah, that was so funny, I\nforgot to laugh. Considering it was\noff-the-cuff, that comeback was spectacular."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160212"
msgid "Swapping \"The Emperor's New Clothes\" with\n\"#RUBS     streaking#RUBEexhibitionism#REND\"… the woman's dumber than I\nthought. Well, the bad joke itself was okay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160372"
msgid "Alright… Since you're offering,\nlet's talk about #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160448"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF.\nThe cyber-NEET living in the Janitor's Closet.\nAge unspecified; background, unknown."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160568"
msgid "Her Servant is a #C236196003Lancer#CDEF. Zero combat experience.\nHer capability as a #ROFS0003#RUBSWizard#RUBE#C000246204Magus#CDEF#REND is below average."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160724"
msgid "However, in terms of waist size, she's the\ngreatest among all the female Masters.\nLastly, she's probably a degenerate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160844"
msgid "What more needs to be said? Surely you don't\nwish to know about that human bed cushion's\ninterests and inclinations, do you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160972"
msgid "One can only speculate so much. No matter how\nluxurious its upbringing or high its quality,\npork is pork! Look no further――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161100"
msgid "Why are you looking at me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161128"
msgid "As you can see, none can match the atrociousness\nof a cow! Though, cows don't do much for my\nstomach. Yes, nothing beats chicken."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161260"
msgid "They're low in nutrition, but their form is\nby far the most beautiful of all pudgy meat!\nHands down, it's chicken all the way for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161396"
msgid "That's when it sort of hit me―\nwhy #C236196003Kiara#CDEF declared that she \"won't fight.\""
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1161488"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF's #C000246204Matrix#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161536"
msgid "Oh. That really saves me the trouble. I can't\nkeep cleaning up after an unbridled Master's\nmess all the time. And it's a big mess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161668"
msgid "It's the final act, at last.\nReady for the end of this tragedy, this drivel?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161748"
msgid "I'm not ready at all. I can't bear to see a #RUBS book#RUBEtale#REND\nI'm in turn out to be mediocre, regardless of\nwhen it ends or if it's my fault or not!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161904"
msgid "Though I empathize with your anguish… Praetor\nand you have no say in the ending.\nThe finale will surely be a grand one!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162028"
msgid "Any ending must be a happy ending to you,\nrose-for-brains. You're something else―but that\nidiocy of yours makes for a fun watch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162160"
msgid "How rude! Hail me as the genius I am!\nPeople have been saying that there's a fine line\nbetween geniuses and idiots since forever!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162292"
msgid "Ah, of course. A \"genius\" can be defined as\neither an \"idiot\" or \"stubborn.\" You may be\none godly idiot, but you're no fool."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162420"
msgid "Wow. I see you understand me well, you literary\nhack. Very well, I bestow you with some\npraise. Need me to sign your book there?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162552"
msgid "…I'm still pretty naive. I never even imagined\nthat I would ever see an idiot wanting to sign\nanother's work. You're one of a kind, #C236196003Saber#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162708"
msgid "Hee hee. Stop it, you're embarrassing me with\nall that praise. Anyhow, where did that nun go?\nOh, were you cast aside?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162828"
msgid "No one asked you. Since I'm not an artist,\nit doesn't matter to me whether it turns\nout to be tragedy or drivel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162944"
msgid "If you're going to ramble away, go ramble to\nyour Master. Where did that lady go? Did your\nsnark ignite and finally break you two up?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163080"
msgid "Who'd let you write the script? I've already\nasked a \"Speinberg\"-level Heroic Spirit to\ntake care of Darling and I's bridal movie!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163212"
msgid "And since you're not even an extra in it,\nplease, go ahead and write something else, like\na #C236196003BB#CDEF-themed \"The Evil Little Mermaid.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163360"
msgid "You philistine. I can't bear to see money get\nthrown around to make trash. Your movie will\nbe crap anyway, so better to ask George."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163492"
msgid "George? George from what!?\nCan't you be more specific,\nthere's a couple of them!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163576"
msgid "Obviously I refer to the one loved by you and\nsome amateur critics. If you go with him, then\nI won't mind financing you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163700"
msgid "NO thank you. You and that nun can have\nthe bloody wedding that'll come out of that for\nyourselves! …hey, where IS your Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163832"
msgid "Ahaaa～ Could it be\nthat she finally got tired of you?\nSwift is Heaven's vengeance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163916"
msgid "Rest easy, #C236196003Caster#CDEF, for you worry in vain.\nLet the chicken scratches flow from you without\ntrouble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164032"
msgid "Impossible!\nYou say you can turn this awful setting around!?\nHow!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164100"
msgid "This is an Imaginary Number Space. Even if one\nwent back in time, the present can no longer\nbe changed. If you can, that means――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164232"
msgid "Surely you're not the Heroic Spirit of\nan editor, are you? Wait, no―you're\nthe King of Editors!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164332"
msgid "No need to laud me so.\nI might be liable to grant a republishing for\nall this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164412"
msgid "Listen, #C236196003Caster#CDEF. To turn a tale from trash to\nmasterpiece is a simple task. A change\nin setting is unneeded."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164536"
msgid "This whole affair is already a masterpiece.\nThe reason being―― henceforth, I have\nbecome the protagonist!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164644"
msgid "Why did you just put your book away?\nYou have nothing to fear.\nPen down the facts as they stand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164744"
msgid "…that's one Heroic Spirit of a mindset.\nSo this is the shameless mug of the man who\nbecame mankind's first \"legend\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164864"
msgid "I don't get you at all, but I'm sure #C236196003Kiara#CDEF could\nhold a conversation with you. Although, she\nstays at least an arm's length away from you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165020"
msgid "Hmph. I refuse to associate with that woman…\nBut I don't smell that pungent incense of hers\nright now, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165132"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF.\nWhere did that woman go?\nHave you severed your contract at last?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165224"
msgid "I'd be feeling pretty good right now\nif that were the case."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165284"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF is off doing her own thing. She can't\nrefuse when she's wanted―it's a bad habit of\nhers. She won't be back for a while."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165428"
msgid "The human subconscious is a strange thing.\nPersonality is born from multifarious desires.\nSheesh, talk about a one-man show."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165556"
msgid "Here's #C236196003Andersen#CDEF.\nThis boy's words always come abruptly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165628"
msgid "Yet, I can't help but perk my ears up.\nMaybe it's because he talks about other people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165716"
msgid "But you just never learn. You must've realized\nby now that talking to me is pointless and\nbrings you no benefit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165832"
msgid "…*sigh*. Do you plan on saying that you're not\nlooking to get anything out of it―no, that the\nknowledge itself is the reward?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165960"
msgid "You're a consumer to the core.\nAlright. This book will be about Egos.\nPick whichever topic you like."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1166064"
msgid "This reader has had enough for the day, again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166112"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF.\nWith all that loose lard.\nHer innocent face belies her savagery."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166208"
msgid "It's ironic. Despite having a masochistic\npersonality, #C236196003Lip#CDEF treats her romantic interests\nas a sadist would."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166332"
msgid "The consequence of her fervent love, her selfish\ndesire \"that you love her,\" her possessiveness,\nis that her target gets all \"tied up.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166468"
msgid "Although #C236196003Lip#CDEF was stirred by a devoted love,\nthe end result was that she would:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166564"
msgid "\"Hold you in her claws,\"\n\"never let you go even if you turn to mush,\"\n\"be happy to whisper her love to you.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166676"
msgid "…names are often fitting and hers fits. She\neats what she likes, chews as if cherishing, and\nlicks what taste is left on her, yes, \"lips.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166816"
msgid "She's a living, breathing shackle.\nTo me, those claws looked like a birdcage\nmade to trap and keep you trapped inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166936"
msgid "But hey, no point in hating that. Love is a\nheavy thing. Those claws were made for stripping\na person of their wings of freedom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167068"
msgid "They're for saddling with lives, so they won't\nbe all floaty. The weight of those #RUBShuge tits#RUBEthings#REND is\nprobably quite spurring, once you understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167232"
msgid "…I see.\nAlthough he ruined it all with that last line,\n#C236196003Andersen#CDEF's explanation captured the essence\nof who #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167388"
msgid "She stood in our way as an enemy\nnot out of a desire to kill,\nbut out of a miscommunication of her affection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167500"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF. With the disappointing lack\nof blubber. Her arrogant look belies\nher mercifulness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167612"
msgid "What a joke. Despite her sadistic personality,\n#C236196003Melt#CDEF treats her romantic interests \nlike a masochist would."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167736"
msgid "Her love is absolute. The consequence of her\nmaternal nature and service-oriented mentality\nis that she \"fully accepts\" who her target is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167876"
msgid "Although #C236196003Melt#CDEF is stimulated by a domineering\nlove, the end result is that she will:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167976"
msgid "\"Keep waiting for you,\"\n\"accept even your most repugnant aspects,\"\n\"keep protecting her whispers of love.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168084"
msgid "She accepts her beloved man, melts away his\nevery pain, sacrifices even her own body to\nprovide a paradise―a certified \"cradle.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168216"
msgid "She's isolation incarnate. To me, I can't help\nbut see those thorns as blades to protect\nyou from the outside world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168336"
msgid "However, to accept that as goodwill would be\nhasty. Love can only exist when there is pain.\nGrowth comes from fighting your own battles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168476"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's love contains pleasure and no more.\nIf you get trapped in a dreamy paradise like\nthat, you'll one day forget that you're human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168636"
msgid "Joy alone won't make you wiser. Life is about\ndevelopment. #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF needs to know that this\nis a human's greatest weapon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168776"
msgid "…her love never develops.\nShe'd be content at that point to\nbe in her paradise with time frozen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168876"
msgid "Sounds like that's the essence of who #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168948"
msgid "Are we done with our chat?\nThen I'm finally free from my duty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169012"
msgid "In the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, good and evil are\nno different. To me, your social justice and\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's personal gain are the same thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169176"
msgid "That said… now the fate of the world is at\nstake. As much of a contrarian as I am, I\nwouldn't stoop so low as to be fine with this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169312"
msgid "Someone here loves individuals so ardently,\nthey want to kill the world. THEY'RE your enemy.\nDo NOT mistake where the final path is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169448"
msgid "…this guy's got skills…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169476"
msgid "Like a student dozing off in the middle of\nclass. Despite being my Servant, his vanity is\nproblematic. You can wake him up, it's fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169612"
msgid "Wha!? W-w-wait, it's all good,\nthe manuscript is coming along fine!\nI'm not lying, it's the truth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169712"
msgid "…………this sucks.\nI wake up from my dream to find a dirty woman\nand a dumb #[kid][girl]# giving me cold stares."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169828"
msgid "It felt like I had finally worked up the courage\nto confess to my first love, only to be rewarded\nby my ears being yanked as I woke up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169964"
msgid "Damn! THREE days to work up the courage?\nThat was a new record for me! How are you going\nto make up for ruining my trance!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170088"
msgid "Hohoho. Don't give him any heed, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nFeel free to completely disregard\nthis embarrassing writer's ramblings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170220"
msgid "The key to #C236196003Andersen#CDEF's observations is to listen, and stop.\nThere's a storm of a comeback waiting\nif you don't reply the right way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170368"
msgid "So, what do you want?\nAhh, the usual chat, right―― Hm?\nThat's an unusual thing you got there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170464"
msgid "I got it, it's to counter #C236196003Caster#CDEF. Be sure to\nhide that amulet tucked in your pocket from her.\nThere'll be hell to pay if she sees it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170616"
msgid "…an amulet tucked in my pocket…?\nI guess maybe he's talking about the\n\"#C000246204Kuda Ward#CDEF\" I bought at the Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170744"
msgid "Sounds like #C236196003Andersen#CDEF knows what it is.\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF is resting in My Room right now…\nThis is a good opportunity.\nI'll try asking a bit about this \"#C000246204Kuda Ward#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170948"
msgid "They show up in Japanese folklore.\nIt's said that they originate from the hair\nof great spirits who are chief hexers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171068"
msgid "They're not actually in my pipeline of skills,\nbut #C236196003Kiara#CDEF there made me curious to look into it.\nShe uses other spirits though, \"Izunas.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171224"
msgid "Are you out of your mind?\nGo get your tongue pulled out by Enma\nover in Hell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171304"
msgid "Anyway, that's a ward against curses.\nIt'll have little effect against #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF,\nbut a BIG effect against HER."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171436"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF aren't your only enemy.\nSHE'S the same type of woman that #C236196003Lip#CDEF is.\nDon't be careless and get bit by her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171584"
msgid "\"Her\"? …sounds like, #C236196003Caster#CDEF?\nWell, I'm always at risk\nfor getting play-bitten by her, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171696"
msgid "#C236196003Lip#CDEF and #C236196003Caster#CDEF are the same type?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171764"
msgid "The very same, I bet. Fox Ears is all wholesome\nwith you, but she's a mass of poison on\nthe inside: a ruthless empress like no other."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171900"
msgid "Though, it looks like she really did reflect on\nthat and punish herself for it. I wouldn't\ngo and push her on purpose, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172028"
msgid "She's a so called \"#RUBS       yandere #RUBEwoman of curses#REND.\"\nKeep a close watch over people you know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172136"
msgid "You look like something got stuck in your back\nteeth and it won't come out. What's wrong? More\ntrouble? A new landmine-girl picking on you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172276"
msgid "Go on, it might be something we can discuss.\nI'm in a pretty good mood. I don't mind giving\nsome advice, so talk to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172396"
msgid "……#C236196003Andersen#CDEF's as harsh as ever.\nGotta say, it's a really good way of checking\nhow well color drains from a person's face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172536"
msgid "I read this book in the library, \"#C000246204The Little Mermaid#CDEF.\"\nIs this guy here really the one who wrote\nthat beautiful, sad story?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172676"
msgid "I was wondering what you were going to say, and\nhere you're asking if I really wrote \"The Little\nMermaid\"? And you think it's beautiful? That?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172820"
msgid "You're absolutely right! You won't ever find a\ncomed―― Erm, a tragedy as beautiful!\nYou've got good taste, young #[man][lady]#!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172952"
msgid "I'm starting to doubt if #C236196003Andersen#CDEF is actually one of the\nthree best authors in the world.\nMaybe this is a fake with the same name?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173100"
msgid "Hmph. I'd feel better if that were the case.\nJeez, you readers have wilder fantasies than\nthe author himself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173212"
msgid "That may be how I make business, but I'd prefer\nif you stow the wild fantasies. An author and\nthe contents of his work are different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173348"
msgid "Or what? Are you going to come up with something\nlike, \"one day, my ten―no―hundred long-lost\nlittle sisters swooped down on me!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173480"
msgid "What author writes books like that―do they\nthink those situations actually happen? Even\nvillage girls don't get as dreamy as THAT."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173612"
msgid "Listen. Authors do peddle their souls through\nbooks, but there are two kinds: stories one\nwants to write, and stories one must write."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173748"
msgid "That which sends an author's imagination flying\nfreely, and most importantly is fun for the\nauthor, is \"a story one wants to write.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173884"
msgid "That which crucifies an author over their ideas,\nand most importantly makes the author\nsuffer, is a \"story one must write.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174008"
msgid "Many readers don't get that distinction.\nThat's why they interpret the myriad of fairy\ntales I left behind the way they do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174132"
msgid "Which explains why I'm under a deluge of curses.\nMy arms are covered in burn marks,\nmy legs are covered in merman scales."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174256"
msgid "After saying all this, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF lifts the bottom of\nhis pants slightly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174344"
msgid "See? This is the repulsive result of all\nthose nasty rumors! \"Whoever wrote these books\nmust've been a really lonely person――\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174476"
msgid "Those fanciful assumptions may have been\nfun for all of you, but they're the reason\nwhy I was made to look this way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174596"
msgid "Understand? All the curses from all the readers\nwho read \"The Little Mermaid\" are amassed on me.\nSo what am I then but an author?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174728"
msgid "Dimwit with the head denser than a village girl:\nI'm giving you this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174800"
msgid "This is a file summarizing my life.\nMake sure to read it well so that you don't ask\nme a stupid question ever again."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1174920"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF's #C000246204Matrix#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174972"
msgid "This kind of feels like exchanging business cards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175024"
msgid "Oh, my. Goodness, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF.\nI never expected you to tell\n#[him][her]# all this yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175132"
msgid "What happened to the man who kept everyone at a\nsharp tongue's distance? Hee hee. Maybe you've\ntaken a liking to #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, too?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175276"
msgid "Your head is thicker than an oversized barrel\nof wine and is just as out of place here, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175388"
msgid "#[He][She]# knows nothing at all, so I'm just playing it\nsmart and avoiding being hounded by stupid\nquestions in the future. No other reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175532"
msgid "…huh? Which one was what?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175560"
msgid "I'm talking about \"The Little Mermaid.\"\nI liked that fairy tale, too. So I'm using\nmy authority as your Master to order you:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175688"
msgid "I'm curious about that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175712"
msgid "…well, based on how he was talking,\nhe probably \"had to write it to teach a moral lesson,\neven though he didn't want to write about a maiden's love.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175864"
msgid "――――Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175880"
msgid "A princess who gets obsessed with her wild\nimagination, runs amok, and destroys the only\ngood thing about her―her beauty!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176004"
msgid "It was so funny, I just had to write it!\nWhile I had a breakout of hives. While I held\nmyself back from shouting, \"die normies!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176136"
msgid "……um.\nI truly apologize… for letting someone with\nsuch a defective personality run loose…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176232"
msgid "It's fine, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF doesn't need to apologize."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176292"
msgid "This writer's sensibilities are simply far removed\nfrom decent, common sense.\nThere's no harm in just writing books, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176420"
msgid "What? You're looking at me like you got put to\nsleep too long and now your cheap alcohol's\nturned into vinegar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176532"
msgid "…well, yeah. Sure, I went a bit far with\n\"The Little Mermaid.\" I up and flew into a\nfrenzy, then wrote it. I'm reflecting on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176664"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF begrudgingly restrains himself,\ncloses his eyes, and reflects on his actions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176768"
msgid "I wonder if he sometimes acts like a child because of\nhis physical age or if his personality was always like this.\nRegardless, this is one Servant you just can't hate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1176936"
msgid "You read \"#C000246204The Emperor's New Clothes#CDEF,\" right?\nAlright, good. Let's get to the test."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177036"
msgid "Look carefully over her body. I'm sure you were\npurposefully disregarding her before, but you're\ngoing to spit out the honest truth right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177180"
msgid "Come on! Look at this obscene body and tell\nme what you think! Shout your thoughts out\nthrough your chest, no holding back!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177304"
msgid "I've been dying to say this ever since we first met.\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's figure is:"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1177404"
msgid "Andersen is pretty dumb, isn't he?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177440"
msgid "T-that's not how it is! I'm as average a\nwoman as it gets! Don't let #C236196003Andersen#CDEF fool\nyou with his smooth talk!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177568"
msgid "\"As average as it gets\"…\nI think I'd have a better chance of convincing\nthe king that his clothes are invisible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177684"
msgid "I see. So this is what it means to speak with your chest.\nNow I know exactly which of these two is lying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177792"
msgid "Huh? T-the thing is… see, everyone here is\nsuch a unique character. A simple nun\ndoesn't really stand out, you know…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177912"
msgid "Who's \"young and foolish\"? You're a woman in\nher mid to late twenties. How many youths have\nyou enslaved with those legs of yours?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178044"
msgid "If you're going to pretend to be a saint, then\nwring out those humongous breasts of yours,\nfirst. No problem, right? You ARE a cow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178176"
msgid "Ah, ah―this insufferable man…!\nWhy is it that all you ever say are things\nthat embarrass others!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178276"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF makes a completely valid point,\nbut I have to sympathize with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178392"
msgid "Apparently, the moral of that book is \"learn to take a hint.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178456"
msgid "This old school may be teeming with problem\nchildren, but please try to be the one pure and\nkind Master around here, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178600"
msgid "Boring. You have NO interest in this matured,\nPRIME meat!? You little honor-roll shi――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178692"
msgid "―――Ah, so that's how it is.\nI should've known better. Yes, I was too hasty.\nSorry. I'm really sorry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178796"
msgid "…heh. Don't finish that thought, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nTeens. Yep, only teens do it for you, right?\nNice. Come meet me some time, low-key."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1178940"
msgid "We've got plenty to talk about, having the same\nstrike zone and all.\nThat cow over there can sit out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179044"
msgid "Not happening. A little man like you\nshould be off all alone and in shambles,\nlonging for his first love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179152"
msgid "Isn't that right, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\nThe only idiot here is that moron there.\nYou wouldn't go and do that. Right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179272"
msgid "I choose to say that so that I wouldn't hurt #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's feelings,\nbut it looks like the result was more frightening\nthan if I would've just spoken my mind…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179444"
msgid "―――Anyway. Explaining every little detail\nwould've been silly, so I asked that in order\nto recreate \"The Emperor's New Clothes\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179580"
msgid "It turned out to be surprisingly dull. This is\nmore of a dialogue to have with #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF.\nIn any case, thanks for reading again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179728"
msgid "If you read it, then I'm sure you understand―\nI'm a pessimist at heart. Whether you're good or\nbad, someone else or myself―I hate everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179872"
msgid "Please don't ask a guy like that about what\nhis work means.\nWhy would I even answer honestly?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179968"
msgid "A pessimist… It's true that #C236196003Andersen#CDEF,\nconsidered one of three best writers in the world,\ndidn't exactly have a bright and happy upbringing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180128"
msgid "Still, he lived out the span of his entire natural life.\nDespite constantly drowning in despair,\nI don't think he ever tried to take his own life…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180276"
msgid "Yeah, that's right.\nAbsolutely disgraceful of me.\nHowever―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180340"
msgid "A person's life has its uses. Whether one\ngoes naturally or by accident, one needs to get\nthe most out of the moment of their death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180476"
msgid "Damn. My life is just one big regret. How could\nI mess up the timing of my own demise? I was\nleft a ghost, simply living out of habit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180612"
msgid "Thanks to that, I'm still tormented by women\neven after death!\nEven though my preference skews way younger!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180720"
msgid "I'm happy to see you've taken an interest in my\nServant, but as you can see, he's an\n#RUBSperverted contrarian#RUBEAmanojaku#REND―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180856"
msgid "Knowing more about him will bring no benefit\nto you. Have you considered that he may\nnot be worth your time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180968"
msgid "…sure, I don't get anything out of this,\nbut I'm curious about #C236196003Andersen#CDEF's past."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181068"
msgid "Just a little more and I'll fill his Matrix,\nso when I have some time I'll go look for one of his works."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181176"
msgid "I take out a copy of \"#C000246204The Little Match Girl#CDEF\" \nthat I got from the Library and start talking to #C236196003Andersen#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181316"
msgid "This book is one of the most famous fairy tales in the world.\nI have no doubt that bringing this topic up will\nlight up even #C236196003Andersen#CDEF-scathes-a-lot's face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181488"
msgid "You really do go out of your way.\nI didn't think anyone these days\nread worn classics anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181584"
msgid "Still, I have nothing to say about that book.\nThe content is as you read it,\nthe ending is as written."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181688"
msgid "Has there ever been a greater waste of time?\nMakes me want to hurl. Hey, how about I tell\nyou about my Noble Phantasm, instead?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181816"
msgid "I don't want to hear it, pacifist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181852"
msgid "I may loathe people, but I treasure my readers.\nThat's why this dope of a voracious reader\ndeserves a fitting reward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181972"
msgid "Here, take this, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. It's information\nabout a useless Noble Phantasm, anyway.\nThis is my final lip service to you."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1182108"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF's #C000246204Matrix#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182160"
msgid "…he actually revealed the Matrix on his Noble Phantasm\nto me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182224"
msgid "Let's see… \"A Story Just For You\"…?\nIt has the power… to turn someone into their \"ideal self\"…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182324"
msgid "Though, I don't do so much these days. The world\nhas gone to hell, a depraved and mediocre one.\nNot many people worth writing about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182460"
msgid "That's why ever since I became a Servant, I've\nhad to earn extra money by making fan fiction.\nNot as an improv#RUBS    poet#RUBE shijin#REND but an improv douji―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182624"
msgid "*sigh*. No more, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF. Keep your vulgar\nactivities to yourself. Being your Master,\npeople will start to question MY dignity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182772"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, please, that's enough for today."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182832"
msgid "I may be a pacifist, but a Noble Phantasm is\nstill a Master's trump card… I kindly ask\nthat you don't tell others about this, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182968"
msgid "Hm? What?\nYou still need something from me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183012"
msgid "To be this infatuated with me―― are you one\nof those? An eager wannabe?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183088"
msgid "I won't teach you the secret to writing.\nThe kind of people who teach others\ntheir craft are no different from idiots!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183208"
msgid "I can't do any fighting.\nAll I can do is state the truth of what\nI see before my eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183296"
msgid "Don't expect anything more. And don't expect\nmanual labor from a WRITER in the first place.\nWhat sort of demon editor are you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183424"
msgid "Still alive, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF? You're looking strong\non the outside, at least. Good!\nYou're worth disparaging!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183544"
msgid "What calamity will befall you next? Don't\nhold back. Out of pity for your unsightliness,\nI'll listen to any complaints you have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183676"
msgid "In any case, this is great for finding things\nto write about. Maybe it'll even inspire me\nto attempt writing an action story!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183804"
msgid "The most important aspect of mass entertainment\nis the effective \"it was all a dream\" hook. No\neffort on this baby, taking easy street here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183948"
msgid "…*sigh*. I never did have anything good to\nsay about my readers during my lifetime, but\nhow do I describe my current situation?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184080"
msgid "A sex maniac and a plebeian.\nThe worst of the worst readers a guy can get.\n\"Truth is stranger than fiction\" as they say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184204"
msgid "But, well, I guess it's better than nothing.\nI might learn something from seeing\nawful readers react to my work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184320"
msgid "What is it, my reader? You want a new novel?\nWell, I won't give you one. Wait around,\nthreaten me―what won't come won't come out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184452"
msgid "Huh? \"When are you going to come up with some\nideas\"? Dumbass. If I knew that, I wouldn't\nbe having this difficulty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184572"
msgid "Writing, pal, is like praying for rain.\nUntil a storm whips up in my brain, I have to\nkeep gathering material like I am now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184700"
msgid "Do you guys play those all the time?\nI see… amazing… I can't believe there's more\npopular entertainment out there than novels."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184832"
msgid "This is the first time I've ever had respect for\nyou. I don't know how you can live a decent life\nin an age filled with that kind of stuff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184972"
msgid "I have absolutely no faith in myself.\nI want to go binge on some \"hacks & slashers\"!\nI can't help it, I want to play right now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185100"
msgid "If you ask me, a girl's secret isn't a topic\nworth discussing. It IS amusing, but take it\nseriously and you're going to have a bad day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185236"
msgid "If #C236196003BB#CDEF chooses girls' secrets to layout the\nLabyrinth, if she put that much thought into it,\nthen she's no joke."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185364"
msgid "Asking me is pointless.\nThat said, asking #C236196003Kiara#CDEF is pointless too.\nAsk someone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185464"
msgid "So this is a Labyrinth Core.\nMaidens are captured and treated as vessels…\nA #RUBSRelief#RUBEwall#REND made in poor taste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185588"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF, who crafted this structure,\nmust have a superb sense of aesthetics.\nNot something I can mimic, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185712"
msgid "Don't believe yourself.\nDon't believe others.\nDon't believe what you see before you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185800"
msgid "An \"impression\" is something given after it's\nall over, anyhow. Talk about \"believing\" or \"not\nbelieving\" in existing things is nonsense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185940"
msgid "I stopped writing, just for a second. The\nstory's ending came to me and I said, gosh,\nthis book is CRUEL. I started hating myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186072"
msgid "What, you want to know if I'm alright?\nAre you worrying over me, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186164"
msgid "…heh. Don't worry. It'll be a masterpiece to\na commoner like you. Once it's finished,\nI'll have you read it first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186280"
msgid "That lizard-woman left and came back AGAIN!?\nTalk about third time's the charm!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186360"
msgid "That's it. Don't hold back―crush her,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. The more women like her pitifully\nlose, the more adorable they become!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186496"
msgid "I thought I would amount to more than\njust an author. But―maybe it's sad to say―\nI don't know of any other way to live."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186620"
msgid "This is the end result.\nI'll just hole up in this orange prison\nalongside#ROFS-005#RUBSthis demon of lust#RUBE my Master#REND until I rot away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186764"
msgid "――No, I won't say it. Too cliché.\nSuffering is the fruit of wisdom that separates\nus humans from beasts. Relish the bitterness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186896"
msgid "Being an author isn't so bad, you know.\nI'll even throw in an ero-nun Master for free.\nWell, I wouldn't recommend it though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187024"
msgid "It looks like the clerk stepped out.\nHe'll be back before you know it,\nso come back later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187116"
msgid "It's the number one item you'll always want to\nhave on hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187180"
msgid "Do you have any #C000246204Return Crystals#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187232"
msgid "When you use one, you can return to the school\nbuilding from the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF in an\ninstant. You'll feel safer having one on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187384"
msgid "Where are these items for sale shipped in\nfrom, you ask?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187444"
msgid "Wh-where DOES one get them, I wonder?\nJust thinking about it gave me chills…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187524"
msgid "Have you obtained any Mystic Codes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187560"
msgid "Since there are many types of Code Casts,\nyou can't judge a Mystic Code on its\nproperties alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187660"
msgid "Have you visited all the classrooms already?\nSome management NPCs are gathered in the\nlibrary. Take a peek when you get the chance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187792"
msgid "I know I've said this before, but you\nought to always have a Return Crystal on hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187880"
msgid "If you're ever like, \"I'm deep in the #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF, and my Servant's stamina is looking\nbad!\" then you can return in an instant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188032"
msgid "You need to buy healing items!\nBut you don't have any Sakurament!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188100"
msgid "In those moments, selling items you have on\nhand to raise funds is a good strategy\nif you ask me～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188200"
msgid "#C000246204Bottles of Medicinal Liquor#CDEF are an excellent\nitem for restoring a Servant's MP."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188296"
msgid "What's bad is that it's a tad expensive,\nbut it's handy to have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188364"
msgid "A long time ago, the Commissary used to carry\nstuff like weekly magazines…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188440"
msgid "Unsurprisingly, it looks like there's no way any\nmagazines will be coming in. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188528"
msgid "A Master's MP can sometimes be the difference\nbetween life or death. So it's an item you\nalways want to have on hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188648"
msgid "When you do take big damage, you'll want an\n#C000246204Ether Crystal#CDEF. You can restore a lot more\nHP than with an Ether Shard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188780"
msgid "Poison, paralysis, curses――\nthey all suck, huh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188832"
msgid "When one of them hits you, it's handy to have a\n#C000246204Remedy#CDEF. With it, you can cure everything,\nso it's useful to carry one with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188976"
msgid "I'm getting used to seeing #C236196003Father Kotomine#CDEF as a\nclerk. Honestly, I didn't think business was for\nhim, at first. You know, with HIS scary face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189136"
msgid "You won't be able to get back items that\nyou've sold, so be careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189208"
msgid "It would be tragic if you accidentally\nsold off an item you can only get one of.\nCheck before you sell, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189320"
msgid "He says all the healing items are sold out.\nThat's a real pain in the neck～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189400"
msgid "That there would be someone here who could\nbuy out the ENTIRE store?\nIt's a surprise to me too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189496"
msgid "But it's all restocked now, so everything\nis fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189548"
msgid "Huh? The NPC that was by the Janitor's Closet?\nMaybe he had an ego-collapse? He was a low\nperformance, old generation NPC, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189680"
msgid "An #C000246204Elixir#CDEF is an item which fully heals\na Servant's wounds and fully restores a\nMaster's MP. …so I've heard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189808"
msgid "Weeell～ The Commissary doesn't sell any,\nso I've never seen one before.\nIt's pretty valuable for a consumable, huh～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189928"
msgid "Do you have any #C000246204Remedies#CDEF?\nThey clear poison, paralysis, and curse,\nso it's best to carry some with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190048"
msgid "Do you have #C000246204healing items#CDEF on you?\n#C000246204Return Crystals#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190132"
msgid "Ugh, I'm so worried.\nDo your best. I'm going to believe\nand wait to hear news of your triumph!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190228"
msgid "Listen to me carefully. One second I become\nthe Mimicry Club chief, the next I'm in the\n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190356"
msgid "You must have no idea what I'm on about.\nMe neither. I'm just an NPC after all.\nI leave the hard stuff to the advanced AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190480"
msgid "Oh, okay. It's not my place to say this,\nbut give it your best.\n…you've got some tough times ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190584"
msgid "Anyway, let's have a good time.\nRegardless of whatever sort of hell this,\nthey say that \"home is where you make it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190704"
msgid "You met this \"#C236196003BB#CDEF\" girl they're talking about?\nI heard she's got a real annoying personality.\nWell―girls are generally annoying, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190860"
msgid "I don't really look at #C236196003BB#CDEF as an enemy, see?\nEven though she was talking shit, saying\nthickheaded people are defective."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190996"
msgid "You're saying a new Labyrinth was made!?\nThat #C236196003BB#CDEF is somethin' else… She can peddle\npieces of her mind, what's up with that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191140"
msgid "Well, if ya' ask me, the gentlelady in that\nJanitor's Closet is pretty scary too. How is\nshe shut all up in there despite all this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191272"
msgid "And she's perfectly happy. That room's even got\nthis sorta' weight to it, like it'll hold\nforever even if the sky starts falling…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191404"
msgid "I wonder what kinda' people used this old\nschool? It's gotta' be an older generation of\nNPCs than us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191508"
msgid "Before me, there were NPCs made to push the Holy\nGrail War along. Before that, there were even\nolder model NPCs…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191624"
msgid "\"A country destroyed; mountains, rivers remain.\"\n\"Pride goes before destruction.\" \"Mountain\nweather is fickle, like a maiden's heart\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191760"
msgid "I've decided…… no, I had already decided.\nLike the #RUBS       sakura#RUBEcherry blossom#REND's dance,\nI too should #RUBS  murmur#RUBEburn up#REND as a poet would……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191932"
msgid "Whaddup.\nI heard the news. Hard to believe that\neven #C236196003Jinako#CDEF got turned into a Labyrinth…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192040"
msgid "Man, #C236196003BB#CDEF is more progressive than even the\nbusiness models for social games, yo!\nA NEET for a boss? Now I've seen it all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192180"
msgid "Huh? My expressions are weird? You want me to\nstop messing around? This is just what I do.\nJe suis part of the impressionist club."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192312"
msgid "This is just another of my impersonations.\nI tried becoming an annoying character\nlike #C236196003Jinako#CDEF lololololol"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192436"
msgid "Doesn't an insect have a soul for 5 minutes?\nIs there not a demand for that weight of pork?\nThat kinda thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192548"
msgid "Even variety show actors deserve human rights.\nOh, but even if you do decide to help me,\nI can't give you a single thing in return!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192680"
msgid "…………that was heavy, bruh. To data-based\nlifeforms like us, the Imaginary Number Space\nis like a nightmare……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192796"
msgid "Please don't bother the other guys.\nAs thickheaded as those#ROFS0003#RUBS  NPCs#RUBE guys#REND are,\nthey took huge damage…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192920"
msgid "Haven't you guys learned your lesson?\n………is that so? Then I won't drag you\ndown. That would be gauche."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193028"
msgid "…us NPCs are powerless. We complained,\nblaming our powerlessness on the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nbanning our liberties in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193188"
msgid "But now that we're in this debacle, we realized\nfor the first time that we really ARE powerless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193288"
msgid "…but you're not like us.\nUse all the power you have―until you're able\nto do it, until you CAN do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193392"
msgid "Haha, just kidding! Even if a normal student\nlike me―the lowest rank of NPC―says that,\nit won't bring an end to all this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193516"
msgid "See ya, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF!\nHurry and get back to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193608"
msgid "―――Now then.\nThat aside, let's talk about a woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193664"
msgid "This woman was essentially a thinking reed.\nLike a rice cake, she would bounce back when\nhit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193760"
msgid "People probably say, \"how tenacious.\"\nPeople probably say, \"what conviction.\"\nPeople probably say, \"how she bounces back.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193884"
msgid "She once became a boss, yet without remorse\nhas shut herself in the Janitor's Closet and\nnow indulges in the internet―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194008"
msgid "To be blunt, I'm talking about #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nIt's nuts how her defense is zero, but she\ndefinitely has an A rank in HP!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194140"
msgid "What a waste, man…\nHer abilities are below average, but she\nhas this way of standing out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194232"
msgid "Unlike me, who's got nothing.\nIsn't there some way I can be leveraged…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194308"
msgid "…hm? A #C000246204Cat Keychain#CDEF?\nYeah, I picked up something sorta like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194392"
msgid "I'd like for you to buy me #C0002462043 pieces of curry\nbread from the Commissary#CDEF. I have a hankering\nfor them since they smell so damn good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194540"
msgid "But imagine what #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF would say to an AI\nwaltzing up to buy curry bread… you know?\nSo, 3 pieces of them, please!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194676"
msgid "Wooah! That's curry bread from the Commissary!"
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1194724"
msgid "　Handed over the\n3 #C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194772"
msgid "Mmm, this scent really stimulates the nerves!\nFinally, after all those days drooling from\na distance, I'm rewarded…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194892"
msgid "So, here's the #C000246204Keychain#CDEF as promised.\nBe sure not to drop it again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194976"
msgid "Hehehe… I'll gobble these up someplace\nwhere #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF can't see me later.\nThanks for helping me with this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195100"
msgid "Yo! What the hell is this?\nI was in charge of Arena maintenance, and now\nI'm suddenly in charge of watering plants!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195220"
msgid "Fuck! I don't know who did this,\nbut as soon as I get back,\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's gonna hear about this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195336"
msgid "Hey, there isn't even an Arena entrance\nin this building! Someone's gonna pay for this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195424"
msgid "I can't say this out loud, but #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF has\ndefinitely gotta be the most devastated here.\nI don't have it in me to talk to him…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195572"
msgid "'ey, you using the Commissary?\nThen… uh, how's Mr. #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF doing?\nDid he seem real unhappy 'bout being a clerk?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195704"
msgid "I dunno who this #C236196003BB#CDEF is, but she's got a lotta\nguts to overwrite Mr. #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF's #ROFS0002#RUBS  role#RUBEduties#REND…!\nI'm shakin' over here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195880"
msgid "Well, if it's not in our settings, then we\ngot none. Our abilities and rank distinguish\nwhat we're good or bad at, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196004"
msgid "I-I-I-I got no real problem\nbeing around #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF.\nWe're just not very compatible, see!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196108"
msgid "I got the impression that they were\nbeing awfully friendly.\nDo those two actually get along?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196204"
msgid "I haven't seen that one Servant around lately,\nthe one that comes out of\nthe Janitor's Closet to buy stuff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196312"
msgid "I wonder what happened to that guy…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196352"
msgid "I saw something, right before I passed out.\n#C236196003Julius#CDEF went up to #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF and…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196464"
msgid "What did they do after that!?\nI mean, #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF's not even injured! Agh…\nI wanna know, but I'm too scared to ask!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196596"
msgid "I was wondering if maybe #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF has been\nwaiting this entire time for a good chance to\nrebel against #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196736"
msgid "With all the power he stored and stored up,\nhe'll blast #C236196003BB#CDEF in one go!\nRight? Doesn't it feel like it'll happen?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196864"
msgid "The problem though: WHEN is #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF going to\nget serious? I've been waiting here for a while,\nready if \"that moment\" comes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197008"
msgid "Won't this put Mr. #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF in a tricky spot?\nHey, check up on him for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197100"
msgid "A lot less people have been visiting\nthe Commissary recently."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197164"
msgid "Don't you get the sense that Mr. #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF\nis feeling a little lonely?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197252"
msgid "You'll still keep\ndropping by the Commissary, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197312"
msgid "Your mind must be racing… but first,\nrelax. Look at #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF. His expression\nhasn't changed in the slightest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197440"
msgid "Man, he's something else. I didn't know\nhow to react at first, but doesn't looking\nat him now just calm you down?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197556"
msgid "I don't know what you're trying to do,\nbut it's alright. In life,\nnothing is ever that big of a deal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197660"
msgid "Take a page from #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF.\n\"When you're not moving, be like a mountain.\"\nI learned a lot of things from #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197808"
msgid "But spare me from that mapo tofu!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197844"
msgid "This ever cheerful and noisy presence.\nVaguely within my memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\na certain name pops up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197976"
msgid "This ever cheerful and noisy presence.\nWithin my memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\na certain name pops up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198100"
msgid "You sound like you're half asleep.\nThere's only one of me around, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198176"
msgid "When your lovable teacher here came to, I was\nsuddenly in this place. I tried to go back to\nthe original school, but I don't know the way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198316"
msgid "And I have an evening class to teach, so this is\nterrible. Everyone must definitely be waiting\neagerly for me to show up! No doubt!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198448"
msgid "…I hold myself back from quipping by reflex.\nI can't remember clearly, but maybe we had a pleasant\nrelationship back in the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198584"
msgid "…I hold myself back from quipping by reflex.\nSeeing that she hasn't changed is a little\nnostalgic for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198692"
msgid "Let's put that aside.\nIt looks like #C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF has gotten rolled\ninto a muck, as usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198800"
msgid "It'd be different if we were under the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's control,\nbut this is the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF: a wild west.\n#C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF needs to stop being so rash and calmly―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199020"
msgid "Now that it's come to this, we HAVE to get back.\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, assist me with this!\nCommence the [Taiga Quest]!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199144"
msgid "I was pivoting between that or\n[Operation Dynamic Escape]. …anyway, I want\nus to find a way to escape."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199248"
msgid "I've got some gifts prepared, too. And with\nthat, let's give it a shot, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI'm counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199368"
msgid "Her intensity wouldn't even let me get in a yes\nor a no, so I ended up involuntarily showing her\nthat I accepted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199484"
msgid "…oh well.\nI'll stop by to listen to #C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF's plans\nfrom time to time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199580"
msgid "Commence the [Taiga Quest]!\nI think we need to first try assaulting\nthe school gate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199668"
msgid "To be honest, I already tried a while ago,\nbut that school gate won't budge no matter what."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199760"
msgid "So, there's only one thing left to do!\nAll we can do is climb it, right?\nSo, I want you to bring me back a #C000246204ladder#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199892"
msgid "Act swiftly once an idea hits you! Now then.\nBring me one as soon as you can, thanks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199980"
msgid "Since I want to climb the school gate, please\nbring me a #C000246204ladder#CDEF. I tried looking, but it looks\nlike this school doesn't have one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200128"
msgid "Your lovable teacher would be so happy if you\ncould bring one back as soooon as possible."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1200220"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200268"
msgid "This is it! Great job, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\nthis ladder feels like it'll fit the bill!\nI'm so glad that I asked for your help."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200400"
msgid "I'll give you this as a thank you gift.\nI was exploring inside the school when I found\nthis a while ago. Use it if you like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200528"
msgid "It should match well with your My Room.\nYou'll find out what kind of decoration it is\nonce you open it. Enjoy♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200640"
msgid "Alrighty, I'm off to climb over the school\ngates. I'll contact you if I succeed.\nBack to school, here I come!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200752"
msgid "Ah! #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nListen for a sec'. The most awful thing\nhappened to me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200836"
msgid "I went to climb over the school gates using the\nladder, when I hit some sort of invisible wall.\nI went up and up, but just couldn't make it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200980"
msgid "…huh? Were you listening when I made my\nrequest last time? I'm sorry to say that\nship has sailed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201080"
msgid "The times have moved on, taken the next step.\nAnd on that note―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201152"
msgid "Your teacher here thinks we should dig a hole\nto escape this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201224"
msgid "My escape is going to make Alcatraz look like\na cake walk. So, did you bring me a #C000246204tool to\ndig with#CDEF? Please do so, as soon as you can."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1201376"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201424"
msgid "I'll give you this as a reward. I found this a\nwhile back when I was patrolling inside the\nschool. Use it if it's useful to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201556"
msgid "Alright! Teach is gonna dig until she hits\npay dirt! I'll contact you if I make it.\nKeep studying on your own until then, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201684"
msgid "Listen to this, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. I was just digging\ninto the ground to escape and all, and what do\nyou know! There's an entire ocean under us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201836"
msgid "Even teach did a double take at this revelation.\nIt looks like it'll be pretty tough to tackle…\nAnd so―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201948"
msgid "…huh? Were you listening when I made my\nrequest last time? I'm sorry to say that\nship has sailed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202048"
msgid "The times have moved on, taken the next step.\nAnd on that note―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202120"
msgid "Teach is thinking, so that we can escape,\nwe could swim through this electronic\nsea under the school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202224"
msgid "That's why I want #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF to bring me a #C000246204tool\nfor swimming across the entire electronic sea#CDEF.\nAnd as soon as possible, please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202380"
msgid "I'll show you some gold medal swimming, so won't\nyou bring me a #C000246204tool for swimming across\nthe sea#CDEF? And as soon as possible, please."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1202528"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202576"
msgid "Thank you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF! So you brought me\na tool to swim across the ocean.\nNow it'll be a cinch to break out of here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202708"
msgid "I'll give you this gift as thanks.\nI found it while excavating inside the school.\nPlease help yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202812"
msgid "Alright! Teach is gonna dive off the roof! \nI'll get in touch with you if I make it.\nKeep your nose in your textbook until then!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202944"
msgid "I attempted that ocean alone, but that's why I\nfailed. There's a reason \"#RUBS  person#RUBE人#REND\" is drawn as\ntwo people supporting each other. So―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203100"
msgid "…huh? Were you listening when I made my\nrequest last time? I'm sorry to say that\nship has sailed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203200"
msgid "The times have moved on, taken the next step.\nAnd on that note―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203272"
msgid "In order to escape, I need someone smart\nto support me. Otherwise, I can't swim\nall the way across the digital sea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203388"
msgid "So #[Mister][Miss]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\nthat's why I want you to go look for\na #C000246204smart kid that can support me#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203520"
msgid "Preferably as soon as possible.\nTeach is counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203580"
msgid "I want you to bring me a smart kid who'll\nsupport this female teacher, hard at work\ntrying to escape."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203684"
msgid "It looks like the Student Council kids are busy.\nKnow any other #C000246204smart students#CDEF? Find someone\nas soon as you can, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203820"
msgid "My grades? They're the best in my class.\nThat's how I'm configured."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203888"
msgid "Huh? The sea? #C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF is going diving?\nWhat the…\nShe's up to her usual absurdity, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204000"
msgid "Alright, I got it.\nI can't do anything else, so let me take\ncare of our teacher."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204084"
msgid "I agreed to help with #C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF. I'll meet\nup with her later, so could you go on ahead and\nlet her know for me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204216"
msgid "………#C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF is looking for a smart\nstudent? To swim across the digital sea!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204316"
msgid "Woah, woah. What is she THINKING?\nI don't want her to be stirring up trouble\nwe don't need right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204420"
msgid "*sigh*….\nGuess I have to. I'll go talk to her.\nCan't have her wasting your time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204504"
msgid "I'll head over to where #C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF is, soon.\nGo on ahead and let her know for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204604"
msgid "Oh! Did you find someone to support me,\nby any chance?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204660"
msgid "…hmm, hmm. I see.\nThat should be perfect, I don't think we'll\nhave any issues."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204740"
msgid "Thank you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. I'll give this to you as\na token of my gratitude. I picked it out of the\ndigital sea a while back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204876"
msgid "Also, take this, too.\nIt looks like you found the smartest kid\naround, so I'm treating you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204968"
msgid "Alright! Now I'm going to borrow his\nhelp and retry that digital sea!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205040"
msgid "I'll contact you if I make it.\nUntil then, keep reviewing your class work!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205116"
msgid "…………the electronic sea is a force\nto be reckoned with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205176"
msgid "…huh? Were you listening when I made my\nrequest last time? I'm sorry to say that\nship has sailed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205276"
msgid "The times have moved on, taken the next step.\nAnd on that note―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205348"
msgid "A necklace of fortune, a bracelet of luck…\nSomeone told me that circles are a lucky shape.\nBut do they conveniently drop anywhere?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205480"
msgid "Nope! Luck is something you go and seize!\nTeach thinks you need the guts to\n#C000246204beat your opponent and take it from them#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1205616"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205664"
msgid "Thank you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF #[boy][dear]#!\nNow neither Teach's luck☆ nor the great\nocean need be feared!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205776"
msgid "Take this as a token of my appreciation.\nI fished it up out of the electronic ocean\na while back. See if it's of any use to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205908"
msgid "Alright! I'm breaking out this time for SURE!\nWait for me, my beloved students. Teach is\ncoming in hot with a bag full of quizzes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206040"
msgid "There was this mysterious door―― and that's\nwhere I hit a dead end!\nAnd so――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206124"
msgid "…huh? Were you listening when I made my\nrequest last time? I'm sorry to say that\nship has sailed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206224"
msgid "The times have moved on, taken the next step.\nAnd on that note―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206296"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF #[my boy][dear]#, it's time to\nstart the final [Taiga Quest]!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206384"
msgid "I've been told that in order to open a\nmysterious door blocking an exit,\nyou need a girl's secret."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206484"
msgid "So, I want you to go get a #C000246204girl's secret#CDEF\nfor me, #[Mister][Miss]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206592"
msgid "Huh!?\nA \"girl's secret\"!? An #C000246204SG#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206644"
msgid "I have my ways… Anyway, I'm sure that I need\na secret that no one knows about yet to open\nthat door. I need it, okay? So good luck!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206780"
msgid "Apparently, I need a #C000246204girl's secret#CDEF to open\nthat mysterious door. And it has to be a\nsecret no one knows yet, see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206912"
msgid "Please, look for one!\n…ah, by the way, I have no secrets, so\nthat won't work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206992"
msgid "Wait a second. Something just―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207028"
msgid "I get the feeling that this enemy\njust dropped something I was not expecting to see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207116"
msgid "I scramble to look through my list of items."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207164"
msgid "――There it is. This is it. \"#C000246204Serena's secret#CDEF.\" \nWell, this enemy we beat… certainly had a\nfemale model… This is its #C000246204SG#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207320"
msgid "Beats me. All we can do is give it to\n#C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF and find out. I have no idea\nwhere else we could get more, anyway…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207456"
msgid "Don't ask me.\nYou're the one who accepted her request."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207512"
msgid "For now, let's go deliver this #C000246204SG#CDEF to #C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1207596"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207644"
msgid "Thanks, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF #[kiddo][dear]#! I know this request\nwas totally unreasonable, but teach knew\nyou could do it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207772"
msgid "Take this as a token of my gratitude.\nIt's a special item that was being\nsecretly kept in the staff room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207880"
msgid "Now at last, I can get back to the school\nbuilding where everyone is waiting.\nTHIS will be my last try!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207984"
msgid "That also brings an end to the [Taiga Quests].\nThank you so very much for all the help\nup to this point, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF #[dear][sweetie]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208132"
msgid "See you later…\nI'll be waiting for you in our afternoon class!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208196"
msgid "Knowing #C236196003Taiga#CDEF, she'll make a real dynamic escape―――\nI'll believe in her success as I go take care of my own business.\nYeah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208340"
msgid "I see this world has come to loathe heroic\nmen such as my humble self! Ooh!\nSurely this is a mass-ex-tinc-tion!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208452"
msgid "Elohim, Essaim. Elohim, Essaim!\nI implore you! O gods and Buddha, please bestow\nme with trials and tribulations!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208568"
msgid "Specifically, bestow a bloodthirsty Shura!\nOr a VERY bloodthirsty Shura! If not,\nthen an EXTREMELY bloodthirsty Shura!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208688"
msgid "At least one good foe worthy of fighting!\nAt this rate I, #C236196003Monji#CDEF, will be so soothed\nthat my backbone will fall out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208820"
msgid "…I desperately try to remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208856"
msgid "The person making a racket before me is clearly a Master.\nIf this guy were an NPC, I would be complaining to his maker."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208976"
msgid "Hm!?\nYou, you're a Master!\nThat's undoubtedly the presence of a Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209052"
msgid "If I keep ignoring him, it seems like\nhe'll just follow me around.\nSo, let's just answer honestly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209152"
msgid "Just as I thought! When I saw you, I\nnoticed the ferociousness in your eyes.\nTruly a Cupid in hell, indeed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209260"
msgid "I say, but in here, I'm the same as you:\na mere Master, together in the fight, the\nstrife. Well, I have no Servant, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209384"
msgid "And being defeated means―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209416"
msgid "Well, about that. My god left me a revelation:\n\"#C000246204I'm not actually a god#CDEF,\" and then departed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209524"
msgid "Even the posture of this primordial, golden\ngoddess was wilden…… just so you know,\nI combined \"wild\" and \"golden\" there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209648"
msgid "After I came to, I found myself all alone\nin this pink school. Since then, I've been\ntoo bored and destructive for my own good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209776"
msgid "He's pretty much in the same boat as #C236196003Leo#CDEF and I."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209840"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF… He seems like a pain in the neck,\nbut right now we need all the help we can get."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209948"
msgid "I'll try inviting him to join the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210000"
msgid "Oh? The Masters are making an escape\nplan, you say? You all feel like\ngetting out of here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210092"
msgid "Obviously we're going to think about getting out\nof here as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210172"
msgid "Answer with \"seppa.\"\n\"Somosan\" means I'm going to ask a question.\n\"Seppa\" tells me that you're READY."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210276"
msgid "We'll leave that aside for now.\n#[Lad][Lass]#, what do you think of this place?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210356"
msgid "I think… it's an antiquated school building\ndyed in an evening glow and a complete contrast\nto the original school building…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210484"
msgid "That's probably all there is to say.\nI'm fond of this school building more so\nthan the other one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210584"
msgid "The sun sets, cherry blossoms flutter in the\nsky, on the roof, in the school yard. Yes,\nlots of cherry blossoms and not much else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210716"
msgid "Yet, there isn't a single dangerous area here.\nOutside seems uninhabited, but this school\nbuilding is filled with good thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210848"
msgid "And there's no concept of time. If you can spend\nhours without any days passing, then this place\nis a Shangri-La or a Dragon King Palace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210988"
msgid "…I'm surprised.\nThat's one way to look at it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211036"
msgid "Like #C236196003Gatou#CDEF says,\nthis school building is safe for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211120"
msgid "Even if this IS the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\ndetached from the normal world,\nthere might be no danger in staying here――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211256"
msgid "I shall not choose a place of asceticism.\nA new world, rather, sends my heart athrob.\nThis is an agreeable place to train."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211380"
msgid "I see.\nSo I guess that's why he's been spewing nothing\nbut nonsense so far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211456"
msgid "…#C236196003Gatou#CDEF doesn't seem like he wants to escape.\nI don't expect him to join the Student Council, then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211572"
msgid "I'll go look for someone else who's capable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211620"
msgid "No, I'll join this \"Student Council.\" This isn't\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. So it would be shameful for\na warrior to refuse to help when asked!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211776"
msgid "Hey, didn't he say before that he was a monk!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211824"
msgid "Ahaha! Your quips are like flashing lightning―\nGrazie! Where there's a will, there's a way!\nSurely this is Providence!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211944"
msgid "Don't be shy, don't be shy. Once I gather up\nmy belongings, I'll meet up with you.\nNow then, look forward to my great efforts!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212072"
msgid "I'm sure I've already looked all around the school building.\nI'll go back to the Student Council Room and\nreport this to #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212216"
msgid "In the corner of the hallway,\nI found a noticeably conspicuous giant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212288"
msgid "…#C236196003Gatou#CDEF?\nI wonder if he's here for something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212352"
msgid "Oh, #[lad][lass]#! Working hard at those\ngeneral affairs today, too, eh?\nTruly good work out there!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212452"
msgid "Agh, yeah. I came to speak to #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF,\nbut she won't even open the door for me.\nI've been utterly defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212584"
msgid "I think this is another trial, like opening the\nHeavenly Rock Cave. Talking and singing amounts\nto nothing, not even a hint of opening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212720"
msgid "And now for my mortal arcanum: imitation! I\nthink it's time for the nude, large-spin dance!\nNow is the time to slip off these cloth―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212860"
msgid "Absolutely NO thank you! Forget locking, an old\nman dancing naked in front of a girl's room\nwarrants a quick report to the authorities!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212996"
msgid "Agh, come on! I have nothing to talk to\nyou about, old man! #C236196003Karna#CDEF, take it from here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213100"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF speaks from behind the door,\nthen alongside a flash of light, #C236196003Karna#CDEF appeared,\nlooking a little troubled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213244"
msgid "…sorry, but please leave.\nIt seems that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is busy cutting the\ntail off of a gigantic dragon right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213372"
msgid "Gwaa! This solar radiance is overwhelming!\nJust like when the Heavenly Rock Cave opened,\nand Amaterasu suddenly appeeeareeed!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213500"
msgid "Anyway. O' child of god, I am slightly\nconcerned about your Master. Is there anything\ntroubling her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213604"
msgid "Now that you mention it, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF had a cat\nsculpture… her \"keychain,\" she called it.\nShe's morose over having lost it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213740"
msgid "The other day when she reluctantly went over to\nthe Commissary to buy sweets, she said that she\ndropped it. It seemed very important to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213884"
msgid "The hell, #C236196003Karna#CDEF!?\nWhat are you blabbering about!?\nI told you to shoo them away, quick!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213988"
msgid "…you heard her.\nSorry for cutting our talk midway,\nbut I ask that you please leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214076"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF's piercing gaze drives us away,\nand we change locations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214156"
msgid "In the end, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF wasn't able to see #C236196003Jinako#CDEF in person,\nbut he clenches his fist with seemingly extreme elation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214300"
msgid "Troubles exist in all shapes and sizes.\nI think I'll do my utmost to search\nfor #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's keychain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214416"
msgid "Well, I suppose I could…\nI'm indebted to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF for helping out with #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nso it might be good to help search for this keychain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214580"
msgid "There's a chance someone already picked it up, too.\nIn the meantime, I guess I'll try asking the students\nnear the Commissary about it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214720"
msgid "Holding the Cat Keychain I received from the AI,\nI call out to #C236196003Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214808"
msgid "\"So I found something that looks like #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's keychain…\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214884"
msgid "Wuhaat! Let me see!\nIs it a keychain of a pouncing cat!?"
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1214944"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214992"
msgid "Wooah! Just how great a messiah ARE you!?\nI'm impressed with how quickly you found it\nwhile I was looking here, there, everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215124"
msgid "Alright. Let's head over to #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF\nat once. There's no time like the present!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215228"
msgid "Without wasting his breath, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF grabbed hold\nof my arm, and I gave in to him dragging me\nout of the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215368"
msgid "Not to brag, but before this I was a beggar monk\nwho didn't know where his next dinner would come\nfrom! Never had any money or much else!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215508"
msgid "Well of course.\nIn the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, all Masters are enemies.\nThey must be defeated, and that's that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215628"
msgid "But this is not the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\nEveryone here is an ally. We need to take\ngood care of the bonds we may form here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215764"
msgid "As a member of the Student Council,\nI intend on putting forth my best effort!\nAll for one, and one for all Gandhara!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215884"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF… hmm. I feel like I've heard\nthat name somewhere before, but also like\nI never have…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216004"
msgid "Well, it's okay. My policy is to forget the\nsmall stuff!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216064"
msgid "A money fixation is the same as a carnal desire.\nI see that your duty is to perform the 108 quick\nand prompt chimes to guide lost lambs back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216208"
msgid "Me? I respectfully abstain! Since, up until now,\nI have never held a conversation with that kind\nof high schooler!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216324"
msgid "1000-Arm Kannon can save 25 worlds with each\nhand. But, I'm incapable of intervening in\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's tiny world. My training is lacking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216476"
msgid "Things are bad now with these #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF. It's\nlike the Six Worlds Rebirth―with the unseeable\nend―but if we quit, our lives are forfeit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216632"
msgid "What? As long as you persistently survive,\nthe road will open by itself! When it doesn't\nopen, feel free to give up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216752"
msgid "Don't worry about #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF. Now is the\ntime for her to comprehend what her own shell\nis. Soon enough, she'll come up to us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216900"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, pour your heart and\nsoul into your search of the Labyrinth.\nI shall also offer my meager assistance!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217036"
msgid "What? This monk can't have sex on his mind?\nNo matter the heresy or sorcery that befalls me,\nmy mercy wavers not!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217152"
msgid "Yes, the time hath come!\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, work with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nand give it your all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217256"
msgid "I wonder if #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF is alright…\nConsidering how she broke down, isn't leaving\nher alone extremely dangerous?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217392"
msgid "Don't worry about me.\nMy past is nothing to write home about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217456"
msgid "More importantly, we need to focus on rescuing\n#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF. Despite everything, she's a\nwoman. She must be feeling helpless all alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217612"
msgid "Hm? The darkness in #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind?\nEveryone has something like that\nwithin them, more or less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217724"
msgid "However, if I have ties to someone who has that\ndarkness and is trapped in it,\nI can't turn a blind eye."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217832"
msgid "That's because being kind in a pushy way\nis what a religious man does best!\nIt's my bread and butter!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217936"
msgid "Well, whether I end up helping or not is up to\nchance… hmm. #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, you may be able\nto open #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218080"
msgid "…hrrrrmmmmm.\nJust standing around and watching makes me\nuneasy. Is there truly nothing I can do…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218180"
msgid "Wait, Praetor.\nThey went to the trouble of preparing My Room\nfor us. How about we call it a day?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218280"
msgid "Wait. Let's put off our exploration for\nnow and go see My Room. I need to talk to\nyou about something, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218392"
msgid "Where are you off to?\nThey've prepared a room for us, did they not?\nLet's go see what sort of room it is, first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218508"
msgid "More importantly, the outfit!\nLet's hurry over to #C000246204where Rin is#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218588"
msgid "Phew. I can finally say bye to this outfit.\nLet's head to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218696"
msgid "Woohoo☆ A new outfit, a new outfit!\nLet's hurry and #C000246204go pick it up#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218780"
msgid "Did you not hear the transmission just now?\nYou should go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218884"
msgid "I'll head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest up.\nMaybe my voice will come back to me by then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218984"
msgid "I have to go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF\nand confirm what's going on…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219072"
msgid "We need to deliver the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF to #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nI can't let his effort go to waste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219204"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219284"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219388"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219476"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219596"
msgid "It's not budging.\nI feel like there's several layers of locks on the inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219676"
msgid "Who the heck're you anyway!? I've had it\nwith newspapers, bills, 'n sermons! \nCome back \"tomorrow,\" by which I mean never!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219800"
msgid "…what a way to reject someone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219832"
msgid "Though I feel awkward now after all that,\nI still have my orders from #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219924"
msgid "I don't think she's an NPC.\nThat means she's a Master.\nShe's trapped here with us,\nso I have to ask her to join the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220060"
msgid "Besides, #C236196003Leo#CDEF is that blonde kid, right?\nHe's trouble for me. I can't stand looking at\nreal-life prodigies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220184"
msgid "Warn him that unless he wants me to post\nlong rant threads about him around the net out\nof jealousy, don't bother #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220324"
msgid "Ah, but you're a different story.\nAs a fellow average-person, you kinda put me\nat ease…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220416"
msgid "I don't have any concrete proof,\nbut I answered by saying, \"we've met before.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220496"
msgid "I don't know how many events in that other school building\n\"actually happened,\" but I recognize #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220624"
msgid "If that actually did happen,\nthen we should be acquainted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220684"
msgid "So we really did, huh? How very occultish.\n….hmm. Out of respect for you, I'll\nquit with the cold shoulder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220796"
msgid "I won't go to the Student Council, but\nI'll watch the room through a stream.\nLeave the troll comments to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220908"
msgid "She won't leave the room, but she'll monitor\nwhat happens in the Student Council Room.\nI guess that's what she means."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221028"
msgid "I don't know how I feel about being watched,\nbut being able to share information is a plus.\nIt saves us the trouble of explaining everything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221172"
msgid "Yet… I feel that leaving her all\nalone in this unfamiliar school building is dangerous―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221268"
msgid "Praetor, give it up.\nThis door is heavier, thicker, and above all,\nmore troublesome than it looks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221368"
msgid "If your concern doesn't get through to her,\nthen she's not worth your time.\nAlso, I dislike hideous bodies like hers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221488"
msgid "I'm with things that are beautiful because of\ndecay, but allowing decay when a little polish\nwould bring out sparkles is a fool's luxury."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221628"
msgid "Besides, if you wish to see decadent beauty,\nyou need only to seclude yourself\nwith me in My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221728"
msgid "If you, for example, were to invite me to binge\non a thousand days of loving, I would not fear.\nMhm. Bring it on, I say!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221852"
msgid "…just talking to her is a waste of time.\nShe doesn't even feel like negotiating.\nAlso, she doesn't seem very useful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221972"
msgid "Let's give it up and go try someone else.\nHaving you around is enough for our\ndifficult kids quota."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222072"
msgid "Ahh. I've seen this before. The more you call\nout, the more they resist leaving.\nA jail where one just spirals downwards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222196"
msgid "I have gone through this too. Yes…\nHonestly, if not for Uzume's festival of dance,\nI wouldn't have climbed out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222312"
msgid "Darling, let's try someone else. Leave this\nno-good woman shut in her cave… That's how a\ncapable #[man][woman]# can show her compassion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222452"
msgid "So, society has reached the point\nwhere life is easy for humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222520"
msgid "She will disappear without anyone tending to\nher, anyone praising her, anyone\nloathing her―――Just like a living ghost."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222644"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Surely you haven't offered me\nyour #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF so that you could present\nsuch vileness to me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222780"
msgid "If so, I shall slay and cast away every\nghost in this place.\nChange that savior mentality of yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222880"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gilgamesh]##CDEF is right.\nI'll quit trying to convince her\nand just go search for other Masters…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223020"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gilgamesh]##CDEF is right.\nI'm just about done looking around the school building,\nso I'll quit trying to convince her\nand just head back to the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "1223228"
msgid "Access to the #C000246204Commissary#CDEF granted."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "1223280"
msgid "You may access it via the □ button."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223320"
msgid "We leave behind the now-locked Janitor's Closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223372"
msgid "……I kinda expected this would happen,\nbut I guess there's no helping it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223448"
msgid "I still feel a little uneasy with just #C236196003#SVT#CDEF and I,\nbut let's #C000246204begin our search of the Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223588"
msgid "How to uncover #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, hm……?\nWe don't seem to have any leads at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223704"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the projection of a\nyoung girl's mind, which has become a Core.\nWe can only hope for a clue in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223856"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret, huh…\nI feel as if the other two were like,\n\"Oh, yeah…\" but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223984"
msgid "That would be big trouble for us. If she herself\nhas a secret she doesn't know about, no amount\nof poking or prodding may do any good…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224120"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… Well, this is just my\nimpression, but she has an avid thirst for\nknowledge. A \"know-it-all,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224264"
msgid "I interpreted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF to be, essentially,\nthe desire for a prince on a white stallion.\nThus… the third may be surprisingly childish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224420"
msgid "Though she appears to be one without pity,\nperhaps she merely has yet to learn a way\nto express her emotions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224532"
msgid "You want to know about my secrets…?\nUs AI have a duty to answer any question,\nso strictly speaking, I have none."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224648"
msgid "However, there are some matters in which we've\nbeen preset to keep silent on. Private matters\n―those would count as secrets to us AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224784"
msgid "If #C236196003Rani#CDEF is somewhat like us,\nthen I don't believe that she would ever\ntalk about her own secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224900"
msgid "I'm unable to define whether such instability\nis merely error, or something of the mind,\nthough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225000"
msgid "What is it, anyway? About #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nJust rile her up somehow\nand it'll all come tumbling out, duh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225120"
msgid "You're saying to challenge her to a competition?\nThat IS one idea. But, one thing…\nwhy is it that YOU know about our troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225248"
msgid "…a typical communication style for youth\nin the internet age… but #C236196003Shinji#CDEF:\nhow come you know what we're investigating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225384"
msgid "Amuse her with a gamble, and expose her\ntrue colors… Yes, the basics are there. But,\nwhy do YOU know of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225528"
msgid "B-by accident! I just happened to overhear\nwhen I was in front of the Student Council Room!\nI don't want to join you guys or anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225664"
msgid "Hm? You say you want to know #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nYou… Again you're becoming more of an\naudacious #[manly man][Amazoness]#――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225804"
msgid "…hmph. I do owe you for saving me, and\nthis could be a chance to flaunt my strength\nif I can do it, but forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225920"
msgid "I, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, am hopelessly clueless\nwhen it comes to the minds of women!\nEven Homer sometimes nods―― Gahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226056"
msgid "I know, since I've been monitoring.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's last secret, right?\nMmm…. Can't really say I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226172"
msgid "…let's see.\nThat young lady puts the conclusion\nfar too ahead of everything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226256"
msgid "Discernment over intuition,\nchoice by necessity over chance.\nWhat happens when one lives as such, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226380"
msgid "Heck if I know.\nI'm pretty sure I told you not to redirect\nevery single topic over to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226492"
msgid "…lose the experience of defeat, you mean.\nWhen those who possess great insight evade\ndefeat too much, they unfamiliarize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226620"
msgid "Victory is assured when it involves one's\nexpertise. If the result turns out unlike what\nshe expects, you may see signs of her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226756"
msgid "…sorry, I said too much.\nAfter all, we merely observed over the monitor.\nI don't want you to take it to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226868"
msgid "\"A maiden's secret\"? Ha! No need to mull\nover it for even a second! You really thought\nI would want to know something like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227000"
msgid "A young girl's troubles can always fall\ninto one of three groups: troubles over her\nface, over her chest, or over boys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227120"
msgid "There's no other topic as worthless to study!\nIf you want some fortune telling on love,\nask someone else. It's not my act to play in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227256"
msgid "…I apologize. As you can see,\ndiscussions about innocent boys and girls\nputs him in a worse mood than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227368"
msgid "But hey, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nThere's no special reason why #C236196003Rani#CDEF would\nhave a secret about love, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227496"
msgid "Such is the mind of a maiden, casually\nleveraging her assets to entice her interest.\nGood lord, she's so proud her face is frozen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227628"
msgid "Hypothetically, if ever there was a writer who\nwould do that, then they should hurry and settle\ndown and switch to making documentaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227768"
msgid "Finished talking? So, how did it go?\nDid you ask what was weighing on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227872"
msgid "What? All you did was get some medicine!?\n…*sigh*. A real swing and a miss…\nThough I'm glad, I also feel lousy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227988"
msgid "Praetor. You need to train your skill conversing\nwith women to get their hearts to open up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228080"
msgid "Heh. Zilch, huh? I can tell just by your face:\nyou didn't get a sliver of action."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228164"
msgid "D-don't get the wrong idea…!\nI didn't check up on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF for some\nulterior motive like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228276"
msgid "…well, hearing that from #C236196003Archer#CDEF like this\nmakes me kind of wonder if I just let a really\ngood chance slip by."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228404"
msgid "Come on, no need to be flustered.\nMy well-trained mind's eye is showing me that\nyou still have more chances."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228516"
msgid "Don't ever keep her out of your mind.\nIf you neglect a girl like #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nshe'll change into a different type of girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228652"
msgid "…hmm. By the look on your face, it wasn't\nthat big of a deal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228716"
msgid "No matter her functions as an advanced AI,\nto keep protecting you while you're in imaginary\nnumber spaces must be tough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228840"
msgid "And she sees it through with a smile.\nSomeone in the position of health management\ncan't do that sort of thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228952"
msgid "She may hold you dear because you're a young\nlady of similar age. In any case, keep\nher in your thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229060"
msgid "Have you finished discussing?\nAlrighty, let's restart the search!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229128"
msgid "The magical energy behind her smile\nis akin to #C236196003BB#CDEF's. L-looks like I'd be\nbetter off not bringing this up ever again…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229264"
msgid "Yes, being alone with another girl WOULD warrant\nthe advent of divine punishment, and I WOULD\nenter \"What color is my hubby's blood\"-mode."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229404"
msgid "That was quick. Was her secret plain,\nlike her personality? Or did she faint just\nbefore she revealed it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229512"
msgid "You engaged well in intimacy, did you not?\nI'm asking how was it. Was her skin warm?\nHer body, lubricated damply?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229628"
msgid "Wh-what the hell is Mr. Gildy here talking about!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229680"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF might come back to the Infirmary at any moment,\nand the priest at the Commissary\nis glancing over here with a shit-eating grin!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229832"
msgid "Why are you losing your composure? Obviously,\nI'm alluding to the condition of her health.\nWas it a cold, caused by a revelatory fever?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229968"
msgid "That AI provides more support than is in her\npower to do. She's not my type, but such a\ndeed must be given praise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230084"
msgid "Since #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF despises #C236196003BB#CDEF, I thought he\nwould hold #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, the same model, in disdain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230224"
msgid "Come, now. That which is breaking is\nalways impressive. All the more if it's\nself-destructing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230320"
msgid "Keep a close eye on her. Without her labors,\nyou all would be tossed into the sea of\nimaginary numbers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230424"
msgid "They say men are ships, women are ports; she is\nprecisely a port. One AI on her own cannot\nsupport you all successfully."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230548"
msgid "…I don't know any details, but it sounds like\nthese two are getting along in their own way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230644"
msgid "―――Mhm.\nMhm, mhm, mhm!\nThat's the Praetor I know and love!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230708"
msgid "!? It's a little startling to hear that while getting hugged.\nPlease stop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230784"
msgid "It's fine, I've made my resolve now as well!\nI'll exhaust my everything for you\nuntil I have nothing left!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230892"
msgid "You can count on and rely on me.\nI shall light my blade with roaring flames\nthat will live up to your beauty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231004"
msgid "…mhm. That'll do. That will do.\nPraetor. Please see me through until the end,\nas you are now, with a smile on your face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231128"
msgid "…I see.\nYou're finally back to your old self,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231200"
msgid "I'm not talking about your memories or your\nbackground. I'm talking about the color of your\nsoul. This is the #[man][woman]# I pledged myself to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231348"
msgid "How about we get this last show on the road,\nMaster? As you wish, I'll personally grab\nhold of the ending you desire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231468"
msgid "P-please wait just a moment! Give me a three-\nsecond timeout here, please! If I look you in\nthe eyes now, I'm liable to grow tails!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231600"
msgid "\nI've yet to figure out what goes on in that head of hers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231660"
msgid "Dang, my heart is pounding…\nI was just about to force myself on #[him][her]#,\neven though we're in public…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231772"
msgid "I guess it took her three minutes to calm down.\nShe then unashamedly returns, and begins with an \"ahem.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231880"
msgid "Silly me, I put on a bit of an embarrassing\nshow there. It's simply my chronic gripe, see.\nPlease pay it no mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231996"
msgid "But you know, you're partially to blame here,\nDarling. You looked at me so excitedly with\nthat handsome soul of yours…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232116"
msgid "I'm happy that she sensed that my will to fight has returned,\nbut why does my Servant have no sense of urgency…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232232"
msgid "Heh. You sure are calculating. Here I thought\nyour meager energy wouldn't be coming back.\nAll it took was speaking with a woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232364"
msgid "Those three needs humans have sure are powerful:\nplenty of sleep and satisfying one's desires.\nLastly, having one's fill of food and drink."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232504"
msgid "Shall we go empty the Commissary of its edibles?\nI don't mind treating you this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232592"
msgid "I couldn't help myself.\nForgive me this one time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232644"
msgid "I typically get defeated by people like\nyourself. How many times have I suffered in the\nface of such a fearless expression?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232768"
msgid "By some twist of fate, I'm staring close up at\none of those expressions now. Really makes me\nwant to say something sarcastic in response."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232908"
msgid "He laughs, as if mocking himself… no, as if\nhe's sincerely enjoying himself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232988"
msgid "Looks like you've awoken, mongrel.\nBut not from some short sleep.\nI speak of the state of your soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233092"
msgid "You look alive. The foolish shadow from\njust a while ago made a clean escape\nout of the underworld, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233200"
msgid "How to put it―――\nYours is an expression worth seeing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233260"
msgid "You're going, aren't you?\nI'm starting to get excited myself.\nTime to get serious and draw out my blades."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233368"
msgid "Throughout human history, slaying gods was\na king's duty. If my enemy is one who takes\nthe throne of god, then I must do my part."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233500"
msgid "I'm pretty sure this man is―――\nOh yeah. A #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF managerial NPC."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233592"
msgid "So why is he tending the Commissary?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233632"
msgid "Hmhm. You don't seem to agree with this\narrangement. Even I can understand that\nsentiment. We very much think alike, you see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233760"
msgid "It appears that not only have the Masters been\ndragged into this affair, but some managerial\nNPCs as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233868"
msgid "This, as you can see: a Commissary clerk. My\ngoodness. I am quite elated. That should suffice\nfor you, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233976"
msgid "A managerial NPC whose #RUBS role#RUBEduty#REND was overwritten…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234044"
msgid "So does this mean that every other human in\nthis school, who's not a Master, is an NPC\nwho was dragged into this whole thing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234172"
msgid "For the most part, yes. Some are managerial\nNPCs, while others may have been NPCs who were\nalready in this old school from the start."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234308"
msgid "Those original NPCs seem to be duped images of\nformer Masters, but in effect, merely virtual.\nSimilar to students from the preliminaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234448"
msgid "Knowing this priest is here is extremely\ndiscomforting all the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234520"
msgid "Please get used to that discomfort. I am\nobsessive and a perfectionist, as you can see.\nNow, I aim to become the strongest clerk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234652"
msgid "This must be vexing for you. Well then―――\nFrom now on, please be sure to support me with\nyour patronage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234760"
msgid "Are you alive, #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF?\n#C236196003Monji#CDEF came courteously to visit you again today."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234876"
msgid "…buzz off. You're so damn persistent,\nvisiting day after day… I guess that alone\nmakes you a worthy man of faith."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234992"
msgid "Come now, don't be like that. I have a present\nfor you today. I heard that this Cat Keychain\nis special to you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235104"
msgid "If you come out, I'll give it back\nwithout a fuss. Come now, I won't bite.\nI'm just curious about something is all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235220"
msgid "I told you, #C236196003Ga#CDEF… I said I had\nnothing to talk to you about, old man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235308"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF, go get it for me. I'm workin' hard\nto hunt a flying dragon, so don't bother me #RUBS and#RUBE&#REND\ndon't let them bother me. That's an order."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235476"
msgid "There are sounds of baggage clattering about\nfrom the Janitor's Closet. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF probably hid\nunder her futon and curled up like a snail into its shell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235644"
msgid "…I apologize for my Master's impoliteness.\nSorry, as usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235708"
msgid "Hmm. Unfortunately, I don't mind. Getting the\ndoor slammed in my face is my specialty. I don't\ncall myself a wandering monk for nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235848"
msgid "Such is the cavern that apprentices enter.\nWe keep asking, with nothing to lose. Finally,\nEl Shaddai is our chance. Don't worry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235980"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF lets loose a hearty laugh towards\nthe apologetically downcast #C236196003Karna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236088"
msgid "It sounds like this isn't the first or second\ntime he's been rejected. Now that I think\nabout it, I feel as if #C236196003Jinako#CDEF had been reporting\nto the Student Council that she was repeatedly getting\nvisits from #C236196003Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236332"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF asks an understandable question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236388"
msgid "Sure, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is an ally, but as to why #C236196003Gatou#CDEF\nis so concerned that he contacts her this way―\nHonestly, I can't really think of why."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236552"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF, asked this, blinks his eyes a few times.\nThen he suddenly laughs as if he wanted to say,\n\"Why are you asking me that?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236696"
msgid "Yes! There's only one reason, it's because I\nhave nothing else to do! Monks have more time\nthan they know what to do with!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236820"
msgid "Ah, my apologies.\nThough that may be true, there's another reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236888"
msgid "That reason is because #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF\nhas \"shut herself in.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236968"
msgid "#C236196003Carigiri#CDEF isn't isolated from the outside world\nby some wall that can be broken by hitting it.\n―――It's a wall in her heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237112"
msgid "All people wall themselves away from pain, fear,\nanxiety, and lies. One could say it's a natural\ninstinct for self-defense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237236"
msgid "But this wall is like a dead end. Those who try\nto distance themselves make their wall thicker\nand narrower while losing their place to go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237376"
msgid "You may as well go suffocate yourself.\nDon't you ever think about taking your Master\nout of there?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237476"
msgid "To an outsider, it might look like #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is\njubilant with her shut-in lifestyle,\nbut #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is imploring here earnestly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237632"
msgid "Now #C236196003Karna#CDEF is the one being questioned,\nand he stays quiet for a brief time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237724"
msgid "….to me, when I consider #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's state, I\nthink that she should get out and exercise more.\nHer gains recently are especially horrible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237880"
msgid "But ultimately, it's just someone else's\nstandard. For as long as #C236196003Jinako#CDEF doesn't desire\nso, I have no intention of forcing her out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238028"
msgid "Yes, truly a generous, divine response. If all\nthe leeches in the country heard that,\nthey would probably cry out with joy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238152"
msgid "But if a hole were to be decisively drilled into\nthat wall, then for better or worse, we may find\nshe desires to expel herself from there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238292"
msgid "…now I understand.\nActing with such audacity is a feat\nwell beyond me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238364"
msgid "Gahahahaha! To be praised by a sage such\nas yourself must mean I'm finally close\nto reaching Nirvana!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238468"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF's behavior is no different than usual,\nbut the contents of his words are indeed that\nof a high monk's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238596"
msgid "Though, I think dancing naked in front of\nsomeone else's room is a more than just a\n\"little annoying.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238700"
msgid "That aside, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF has been referring to #C236196003Karna#CDEF as a \"sage\" and\n\"child of god.\" It makes him sound kind of divine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238848"
msgid "Could #C236196003Karna#CDEF actually be a Heroic Spirit\nof salvation or something…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238936"
msgid "Come now, that itself must be a great\nundertaking. Without excluding anyone, you take\nthe hands of those who want, and give."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239064"
msgid "A human with any selfishness can't attain such a\nmindset. Knowing that the \"Heroic Spirit of\nCharity's\" prestige is no lie has saved me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239204"
msgid "I'm really only running errands right now.\n…I'll keep your words in mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239280"
msgid "…ah, before I forget, I haven't given you my\nthanks for finding the lost item, have I?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239368"
msgid "Erm, despite all the preaching I was doing,\nthe one who found the keychain was #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\nnot me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239480"
msgid "To one obsessed with the divine like me,\nhaving the chance to speak to that god's son is\nreward enough. Please thank the #[lad][lass]# instead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239624"
msgid "Is that so? Then #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nThough it's merely a trifle, please accept\nthis gift."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1239720"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF's #C000246204Matrix#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239768"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF has no intention of fighting. As you\nmight guess, I can't give you everything, but I\nthink there's no problem showing this to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239924"
msgid "I graciously receive it, \"Okay, if that's the case.\"\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF also seems to be lauding #C236196003Karna#CDEF,\nso once we get back to My Room we can look it over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240100"
msgid "Well then. My business here is done,\nso I'll return to my Student Council duties.\nToday, I'm scrubbing toilets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240212"
msgid "Alright.\n…if you would like to, please come check in\non #C236196003Jinako#CDEF again sometime."
msgstr ""

